<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">- Adele Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Begyu-dɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Begyu Bɔɔ Gɩkpa-Nyɔɔfɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Begyu-dɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Be</para>
  <para style="mt1">Begyu Bɔɔ Gɩkpa-Nyɔɔfɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya ma Egyu Ahasiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Egyu Ahabi diku dɩɩ gama fɔ, Mowabi gɩfɩɩ gɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ tɔ be yela Isareli gɩfɩɩ gii koro. <verse eid="2KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />Duwi dɩkɩ Ahasiya gɛtɛ è di Isareli wogyu-fon fɔ e ye wabansʋrʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Samariya fɔ gatala ɛ bɛ nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ e pira kpaan. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ sa bɛnɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ san Ekuron bete bookpen Baali-Sebubi wanɩ, yàà ma lila ɩ nʋn alɛ nan tɔ n ye miin geyeba nyagɩ gaanɩ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Mɔ Wurubwarɛ wɔsalɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Tisibe-te Eliya alan, &lt;&lt;Tɔ san ma tuma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ Samariya wogyu ɛ sa lɛ, fɔ àà lila bɛ alan, &lt;Gesilɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛn ma Isareli, gɛ ɩɩ fɔrɔ Ekuron wokpen Baali-Sebubi wakʋn yàà ma lila ade lɛ loo?&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;An nan tɔ a ye àà geyeba nyagɩ gaanɩ, diku gɛ aà ku!&gt; Gɛ Eliya ɛ da. <verse eid="2KI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Gɛtɛ bɛnɩ-salɛ fɔ be biri bɛ ba egyu-dɩrɛ wakʋn fɔ, e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ i biri bilen gɛlɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ete ɛkɩ e be tuma tɩ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ tɩ alɛ ti biri tɩ san egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛ sa tɩ fɔ wakʋn, fɔ tàà ma dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ Yahwe alan, &lt;Gesilɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛn ma Isareli, gɛ ɩɩ fɔrɔ Ekuron wokpen Baali-Sebubi anɩ yàà ma lila nʋn lɛ loo? Gɛlɛ wuu koro an nan tɔ a ye aa geyeba nyagɩ gaanɩ, diku gɛ aà ku!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu fɔ e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Lan gɛ ete gɛtɛ e tuma yɩ gɛ e lila yɩ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ fɔ è we?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" />Gɛ be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ete fɔ ɛ̀ sa bɛnan baakpa yɩɩ gɛgba, gɛ ɛ̀ ban gɩnan-kpa giililɛ.&gt;&gt;Gɛ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Eliya Tisibe-te fɔ gɛ wù di.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ sa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (50) ma bɔɔndɩrɛ Eliya wakʋn. Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, Eliya è si odon wuu duyu, gɛ bɩta bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ ɛ bʋn ɛ san waakʋn ɛ ma dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ, egyu alɛ waran ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi ǹ di gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ bɩrɛ fɔ, ɔtan wu ye gatala wʋ be kuma awɔ ma aa bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo fɔ powu!&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ ɔtan wu ye gatala wu be kuma ɛwɔ ma wɔ bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo fɔ wu wolo disere-kɩlɩn.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Wʋ mɛ gɛlɛ fɔ, egyu fɔ e biri ɛ sa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (50) ma bɔɔndɩrɛ Eliya wakʋn. Gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Eliya alan, &lt;&lt;Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ, egyu alɛ waran ba bilenten!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi ǹ di gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ bɩrɛ fɔ, ɔtan wu ye gatala wu be kuma awɔ ma aa bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo fɔ powu!&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ ɔtan wu ye gatala wu be kuma ɛwɔ ma wɔ bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo fɔ wu wolo disere-kɩlɩn.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, egyu fɔ e biri ɛ sa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ-siyefɛ ɛkɩ ma wɔ bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (50) Eliya wakʋn. Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ-siyeefɛ nyawɔ bɩrɛ, ɛ san Eliya bʋnʋn gɛ ɛ waran e kura wakpin yii koro, gɛ ɛ fɔ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ, ntɛ fɔ wɔ gɛ, we ɛtɩ ma bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo nyabɛ gɛtɛ tì di aa bɛsaranyan lɛ tii gutunkoro. <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Nya! Ɔtan wu ye gatala wu be kuma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ bɛnyɔɔ-gyangbasɛ fɔ ma bɔɔ bɛnɩ powu. Mɔ we miin gutunkoro, fɔ àà yɛ nan sara nkpa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔsalɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Eliya alan, &lt;&lt;Kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton wɔ̀, ɛyɩ ma ɛwɔ ɩ waran ɩ san.&gt;&gt; Okoro Eliya ɛ tɔ gɛ ɛbɛ ma ɛwɔ bɛ waran bɛ san egyu fɔ wakʋn. <verse eid="2KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe alan, &lt;Gesilɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛn ma Isareli, gɛ ɩɩ fɔrɔ Ekuron wokpen Baali-Sebubi anɩ, yàà ma lila ɩ nʋn lɛ loo?&gt; Ade nyayɩ gɛtɛ a mɛ lɛ yii koro, an nan tɔ a ye aa geyeba nyagɩ gaanɩ, diku gɛ aà ku!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Okoro Ahasiya e ku, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ tɛ Eliya alɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. Gɛ gɛtɛ Ahasiya en wo ebi-tenibi okoro, wonobi Yoram gɛ bɛ ka bɛ sɩ̀ bugyu be sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ, Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yehosafati wobi Yehoram bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ powu gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Ahasiya ɛ mɛ powu fɔ bɛ sa Isareli begyu bɔɔ gɩkpa gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubwarɛ wɔkɛma wʋ bʋma Eliya wʋ da gatala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />Ɔya wʋ bɛ nɩma gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ da ma dɩkpafʋlʋbenten dii koro ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka Eliya da gatala, fɔ Eliya ma Elisa be ye Giligali bɛɛ fɔrɔ. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ Elisa alan,&lt;&lt;Sara nfan! Yahwe ɛ sa mɩ Beteli&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:2">Mɔ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe na tɛ wɔ̀, gɛ na nya na tɛ wɔ̀ alɛ mɩn nan kere wɔ̀ n ya.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɔɔ bɛnyɔɔ bɛ waran bɛ da Beteli.<verse eid="2KI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ dikpi gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Beteli fɔ be be lila Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;À nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ ka aafonte e ye aakʋn ǹdò?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:3">Gɛ Elisa e yera bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn ǹ nyɩ̀. Mɔ ɩ kara tabʋrʋ waade!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Elisa, sara nfan, Yahwe ɛ sa mɩ Yeriko.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:4">Gɛ Elisa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe, gɛ na nya na tɛ wɔ̀ alɛ mɩn nan kere wɔ̀ n ya.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɔɔ bɛnyɔɔ bɛ san bɛ da Yeriko.<verse eid="2KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ dikpi gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yeriko fɔ be be lila Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;À nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ ka aafonte e ye aakʋn ǹdò?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:5">Gɛ Elisa e yera bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn ǹ nyɩ̀. Mɔ ɩ kara tabʋrʋ waade!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Sara nfan! Yahwe ɛ sa mɩ Yodan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:6">Mɔ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe na tɛ wɔ̀, gɛ na nya na tɛ wɔ̀ alɛ, mɩn nan kere wɔ̀ n ya.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɔɔ bɛnyɔɔ bɛ san bɛ da.<verse eid="2KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ baanɩ bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛ tɛrɛma bɛ bɛ san Yodan, gɛ bɛ ma yela ɔfɔ bɛrɛɛ ma ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Eliya ma Elisa bè yela fɔ, fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn bù ten Eliya ma Elisa. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Eliya e tiri wɔ gɛgba, gɛ e filin gɩ, gɛ ɛ ka gɩ ɛ fʋbʋlɩ butu fɔ buu koro. Gɛ butu fɔ bu yo akpen anyɔɔ dɩbɩyan ma ologyi gɛ bɔɔ bɛnyɔɔ bɛ san gɛtʋnkwaa-kɔlɛ gii koro bɛ kààrà.<verse eid="2KI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Gɛtɛ bɛ kààrà be were fɔ, Eliya e lila Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ mɩ ade gɛtɛ à len nan mɛ n tɛ wɔ̀ pɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka mɩ ye aakʋn?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:9">Gɛ Elisa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ mɩ nan wura aa sunsun gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa aanɩ lɛ wuudu dɩnyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan &lt;&lt;Ade ma ɔkɛma gɛ a lila lɛ. Mɔ gengyi à we mɩ, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yahwe è de mɩ ɛɛ fɔrɔ gatala fɔ, aà wura gɩnyan gɛtɛ aa lila lɛ. Mɔ gengyi an we mɩ fɔ an nan wura.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san bɛɛ tabʋrʋ fɔ, disere-kɩlɩn fɔ tiiramisan ɛkɩ ma abengyi gɛtɛ ii tiira wɔ gɛ ɔtan wuu gye wu silin yɩ fɔ, i be yo bɔɔ bɛnɩ bɛnyɔɔ boo getite, gɛ dɩkpafʋlʋbenten dɩ ka Eliya dɩ da gatala. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Gɛtɛ Elisa e we ade nyayɩ fɔ, ɛ gbɛrɛ afala alan, &lt;&lt;Miinte! Miinte! Isareli wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ ma wabengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ Elisa en mini we wɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa e gye wɔ ngba ɛ fɛɛran.<verse eid="2KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa ɛ kukuru Eliya gɛgba gɛtɛ gi ye wakʋn gɩ nʋ̀n fɔ, gɛ e biri ɛ san ɛ ma yela Yodan getu-kere. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Gɛ Elisa ɛ ka gɛgba gɛtɛ gi ye Eliya wakʋn gɩ nʋ̀n fɔ ɛ fʋbʋlɩ butu fɔ buu koro. Gɛ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe, Eliya wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ de?&gt;&gt; Gɛtɛ ɛ ka gɛgba fɔ ɛ fʋbʋlɩ butu fɔ buu koro fɔ, bu yo akpen anyɔɔ, gɛ ɛ kààrà ɛ da.<verse eid="2KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ boo dikpi gɛtɛ be ye Yeriko fɔ be we ade nyayɩ fɔ, bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Eliya wo sunsun fɔ wʋ̀ sa Elisa wanɩ.&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ san bɛ ma tuma wɔ, gɛ be kura wɔ. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya! Ɛtɩ aa bɛsaranyan tɩ̀ ba bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (50). Yɛ bɛ bàà san ma buguti aafonte. Nkɩfɔ anlɛ Yahwe gifiye gɩ ka wɔ gɩ bʋn gatala gɛ gɩ ka wɔ gɩ ma sɩ̀ odon wʋkɩ wuu koro abɛɛ dɩtagba dɩkɩ daanɩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:16">Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa, ɩ kara sa bɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Mɔ bɛ nyɩ wɔ gɛlɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛn mɩnɩ talɩ èè terema. Okoro ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ bɛ bàà san!&gt;&gt;Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ sa bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (50) bɛ ma bugiti Eliya awi asiyee, mɔ ben we wɔ. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Gɛtɛ Elisa è si Yeriko ditele ee so bɛ, gɛ be biri bɛ ba wakʋn fɔ, e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn dɔ̀ yɩ alɛ ɩ kara san?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa ɛ yɛ Yeriko butu bʋ mɛ butu-kpara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yeriko ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ dɔ̀ Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Tiifonte, nya! Ditele nyadɩ dɩɩ gɛsarakʋn gɩ̀ kɔlɔ, anlɛ gɛtɛ aa we lɛ. Mɔ gɛtɛ butu fɔ bʋn kɔlɔ okoro, wʋ yɛ gɛtɛ anyan-fʋnlɛ ɩn taa pe gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ka tasa-fon ɛkɩ ɩ mɔma mɩ, fɔ yàà sa bʋbɔlɛ wanɩ. Okoro bɛ ka yɩ bɛ mɔma wɔ.<verse eid="2KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />Gɛ Elisa e ye ɛ san getu fɔ gii duyu, gɛ e fun bʋbɔlɛ fɔ ɛ sa gaanɩ ɛ dɔ̀ alan,&lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Na fi butu nyabʋ na mɛ butu-kpara. Bʋn nan nɩ yɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ èè ku, gɛ anyan yaà ti pe gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Elisa wanyun-gyebi gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ yii koro, butu fɔ bu biligi butu-kpara be ye ma ǹdò.<verse eid="2KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa wade ma gɩsaa gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Elisa e ye Yeriko ɛ san Beteli. Gɛtɛ ɛ̀ san osele waanɩ ɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ, bɛsaranyan bɛkɩ be ye ditele fɔ daanɩ bɛɛ sa wɔ dɩkpàtà. Bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Duyu-kpalɛ diite, kpe ye nfan! Duyu-kpalɛ diite, kpe ye nfan!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />E fi ɛ nya bɛ, gɛ ɛ fwala bɛ Yahwe diyere daanɩ. Gɛ begbongbon bɛnyɔɔ be ye gɩkan gaanɩ bɛ bɛ fɛɛran-fɛɛran bɛsaranyan fɔ baanɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma bɛnyɔɔ (42). <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Gɛ ɛ san ɛ da Kameli wodon wuu koro, gɛ ye dʋkɔ fɔ e biri ɛ da Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Akpa i sere Isareli ma Mowabi boo getite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yehosafati bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Ahabi wobi Yoram e be di bugyu Isareli. Ɛ sara Samariya ditele daanɩ. E di bugyu fɔ bɩkyan fwo bʋnyɔɔ. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn, mɔ nka anlɛ gɛtɛ wote ma wɔna bɛ mɛ fɔ. E gbena Baali dɩtaa gɛtɛ wote e sere fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />Mɔ ɛ bɔ ɛ mɛ ade-kpen gɛtɛ Nebati wobi Yerobowam ɛ mɛ, gɛtɛ wʋ yɛ Isareli e gyu ade-kpen yaanɩ fɔ. En kere ade-kpen fɔ yɩɩ gɛmɛ ya.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Waanɩ fɔ Mowabi wogyu-dɩrɛ Mesa è de bɛnan, gɛ wù di gɛtɛ èè le bɛyɛran atan asepekyi ton (100,000) ma bɛyɛran baanu asepekyi ton (100,000) ɛ tɛ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Mɔ egyu-dɩrɛ Ahabi diku dɩɩ gama fɔ, Mowabi wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɔ e yela Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ wo koro. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ Yoram ɛ tɔ e ye Samariya ɛ san ɛ ma kʋla wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Isareli fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Gɛ ɛ sa Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yehosafati ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Mowabi wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɔ e yela miin koro. Okoro aà yɛ aa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bàà fɩya ma mɩɩn bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ tàà ma kpà ma Mowabi bete?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:7">Gɛ Yehosafati e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, nan san. Ǹ sa tɛ wɔ̀, mɩɩn bɛnɩ bè di gɛ aayo, gɛ maabengyi ì di gɛ aayo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Gɛ Yehosafati e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ma osele-mɔmɔ gɛ taà da tɩ ma kpà ma ɛbɛ? Gɛ Yoram e tiri wuunyun alan,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:8">&lt;&lt;Ma Edom wotonkuma waanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Okoro Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ, ma Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ, ma Edom wogyu-dɩrɛ bɛ tɔ. Gɛtɛ bɛ san gɛlɛɛ awi kwarankɩ fɔ, bɛn mɩnɩ ma butu gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ ma bɛnan gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ fɔ bàà nyʋn.<verse eid="2KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋʋn! Yahwe ɛ ka ɛtɩ begyu-dɩrɛ besiyee nyabɛ ɛ ba gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ ka tɩ sa gɛ Mowabi walɔ yaanɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehosafati e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ ɛn ma nfan gɛtɛ tàà da ma wo koro ti lila Yahwe ade gɛtɛ wù di gɛtɛ tàà mɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:11">Ɛwʋ gɛ Yoram bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ ɛkɩ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, Safati wobi Elisa ɛ̀ sa nfan. Ɛ tɛrɛma Eliya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;È di gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gbagba.&gt;&gt; Okoro begyu-dɩrɛ besiyee fɔ bɛ san Elisa wakʋn.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa e lila Isareli wogyu alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn n sa ɛtɩ ma awɔ tii getite? San aate bɛtabʋrʋlɛ ma aana bɛtabʋrʋlɛ baakʋn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:13">Gɛ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa, yema Yahwe na kpèlè ɛtɩ begyu-dɩrɛ besiyee nyabɛ e bom gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka tɩ sa Mowabi walɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Gɛ Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe, ɔkɛma powu wuute gɛtɛ ntɛ sʋma fɔ alɛ, gengyi nka Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yehosafati gɛ ntɛ tɛ gebù fɔ, mɩn daà fi n nya yɩ gba, gɛ mɩn daà ka yɩ bɩta gba. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Mɔ kpèlè adʋlɛ wɔtàlɛ ɛkɩ mɔma mɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ gɛtɛ adʋlɛ wɔtàlɛ fɔ ɛɛ tà adʋlɛ fɔ, Yahwe wɔkɛma wʋ ba Elisa wo koro. <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe alɛ i kunla afwe yàà sɔ kpekpesi dɩtagba nyadɩ gɛtɛ dɩ nyʋn butu lɛ daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Yema Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alɛ gifiye gɩ nan gbɛrɛ yàà nʋn, gɛ ɩn nan we ɛsʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n, mɔ dɩtagba nyadɩ daà yɔn ma butu, fɔ ɛyɩ ma yɩɩ bɛkwɔ, ma yɩɩ bɛnan-kurumakyɛɛ yàà nyʋn. <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Ade nyayɩ in di ade-kɛmalɛ ɩkɩ tɛ Yahwe ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ. Ɛɛ̀ nɩ ka Mowabi ɛ sa yaalɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />Yaà muru baatele gɛtɛ bɛ mara ɩpɔrɩ bɛ sa fɔ ma baatele gbaa-gbaa-kamasɛ. Yaà kebi oyon-kpara-kamasɛ, yàà sʋ boo butu, fɔ yàà fun ataa mɩna bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa-kpara-kamasɛ.<verse eid="2KI 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />Gɛtɛ kere gɩkpa gagyɩgyan, baà tɛ gedi fɔ, butu ntɛ da ye Edom gɩlan. Gɛ gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ powu gi to ma butu.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Gɛtɛ Mowabi bete powu bɛ nʋn gɛtɛ begyu-dɩrɛ fɔ bɛɛ ba akpa ma ɛbɛ fɔ, be kpèlè eteni-kamasɛ, bɛsaranyan ma bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ baà talɩ bɛ san akpa fɔ be tuma ɔbalan waanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Gɛtɛ Mowabi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ tɔ gagyɩgyan, gɛ ofila wʋʋ gbɛrɛ butu fɔ buu koro fɔ, be we gɛtɛ butu gɛtɛ bʋ̀ dɔ̀ bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ bʋ̀ sɩna anlɛ nkalan. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ gbɛrɛ afala alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya nkalan! Waà mɛ begyu-dɩrɛ fɔ booko-booko bɛ kpà gɛ be wolo bɛwɔlɔn. Okoro, Mowabi bete, ɩ yɛ tàà san tɩ ma kpila baanyɩmɩnyan!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Mɔ gɛtɛ Mowabi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be gyu Isareli bɩtà bʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn gaanɩ fɔ, Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛ tɔ, gɛ bɛ kpà ma Mowabi bete fɔ, kʋtʋmaa Mowabi bete fɔ be serenti. Gɛ Isareli bete be gyu gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ be to gɩ, gɛ be wolo Mowabi bete fɔ baanɩ kpekpesi. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />Isareli bete fɔ be muru Mowabi bete fɔ baatele, gɛ baanɩ-kamasɛ e fun dɩtaa ɛ sa gɛtʋnkwaa-kpara-kamasɛ gaanɩ kʋtʋmaa ataa fɔ i tin ntʋnkwaa fɔ. Bɛ sʋ Mowabi bete fɔ baatu, gɛ be kebi oyon-kpara-kamasɛ. Kiri-Haraseti ditele diiko gɛ be kere bɛ ya gɛtɛ bɛn kya daataa. Mɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bè de bɛtaya fɔ bɛ sʋ dɩ bɛ sa, gɛ be gye dɩ bɩtà.<verse eid="2KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Gɛtɛ Mowabi wogyu-dɩrɛ e we gɛtɛ akpa fɔ ɩɩ da wɔ fɔ, ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ nkpɩn busiyee ma akpilin ton (700) ɛ fɩya ma koro gɛtɛ bàà duru ye ma Edom wogyu-dɩrɛ wakʋn, mɔ bɛn talɩ. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Mowabi wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ka wobi-teni-gyangbasɛlɛ gɛtɛ nafɔ eè bè di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ wo diku dɩɩ gama fɔ ɛ tɛ gedi, ditele fɔ dɩɩpɔrɩ wuu koro. Ade fɔ ɩ mɛ Isareli bete gɩsaa ɩ kààrà, gɛ be ye ditele fɔ daanɩ bɛ da ɛbɛ gbagba bɔɔlɛ.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Elisa e to ɛkpɩnsɔ ɛkɩ ɛ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Ɛna ɛkɩ gɛtɛ nafɔ wɔsan è di Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ fɔ e wula ɛ tɛ Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩɩnsan gɛtɛ nafɔ è di aasaranyan fɔ e ku, gɛ à nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ ka ɛ ka oturu-kpara ɛ sʋma Yahwe. Mɔ è de gutoro, gɛtɛ wʋ yɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ è de gutoro fɔ ɛɛ ba ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ ka miin bebi-tenibi bɛnyɔɔ ma mɛ wɔ bɛdɩ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ nan talɩ n ka n kpa wɔ̀? Dɔ̀ mɩ gɩnyan gɛtɛ à ba aa dikwo daanɩ?&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛna fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Aasʋgʋgyan ɛn ma gɩnyankɩ pilim-pilim, bʋnɔ bɛrɛɛ bʋkɩ buuko n sa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;San ma fɔ aawɔlɔn ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛgalɔn-kwaa bàà sɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ à len.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, gyu dikwo, fɔ àà tan ɔpʋnʋ sa ɛyɩ ma aa bebi fɔ, fɔ àà daa bʋnɔ fɔ sa bɛgalon fɔ baanɩ. Gengyi galon wʋkɩ wʋ̀ yɔn fɔ, kpema wʋ sɩ̀ gɩlan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Okoro ɛna fɔ e kpe e ye Elisa wakʋn. Gɛtɛ ɛ ba dɩkpaara fɔ, ɛ tan dikwo ɛ sa ɛbɛ ma wo bebi fɔ. Bebi fɔ bɛɛ ka bɛgalɔn fɔ bɛ mɔma wɔ, fɔ ɛwɔ mɔ ɛɛ da bʋnɔ fɔ ɛ sa baanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Gɛtɛ bɛgalɔn fɔ powu bɛ yɔn fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wo bebi fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka galɔn-fon tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:6">Ɛwʋ gɛ wobi fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Galɔn wʋkɩ wun mini kuruma.&gt;&gt; Gɛ bʋnɔ fɔ bu ten.<verse eid="2KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛna fɔ ɛ san ɛ ma dɔ̀ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ. Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San ma fu bʋnɔ fɔ, fɔ àà le aatoro fɔ. Ka sɩka gɛtɛ eè kuruma fɔ nya ɛyɩ ma aa bebi yii koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa ɛ yɛ Sunami-na ɛkɩ wobi e biri e wura nkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Duwi dɩkɩ, Elisa ɛ san Sunemi. Fɔ ɛkyɩnyɩn-na ɛkɩ ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ gɛtɛ ɛɛ tɩ̀ nyɩ̀ Elisa alɛ e ten wakʋn fɔ èè di. Okoro ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ Elisa è gyu dʋkɔ fɔ, ee ten dʋkɔ e di. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Gɛ ɛna fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsan alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ nyɩ gɛtɛ ete nyawɔ gɛtɛ ɛɛ tɩ ba nfan lɛ è di gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Okoro yɛ tàà mɛ dikwobi gɛwalɩkʋn gatala, fɔ tàà sɩ̀ wɔ npa, ma ɔkpʋlɔ, ma gɛbɩya, ma kandɩya dʋkɔ. Ɛwʋ fɔ, ɛɛ̀ talɩ ɛ tɩ̀ sara daanɩ ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba taakʋn fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Duwi dɩkɩ Elisa e biri ɛ san Sunemi, gɛ ɛ bʋn ɛ san dikwo fɔ daanɩ ɛ ma dʋrɔ. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsaranyan Gehasi alan, &lt;&lt;Kpèlè Sunami-na fɔ tɛ mɩ!&gt;&gt; Okoro e kpèlè ɛna fɔ, gɛ e be yela wɔ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsaranyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;Tii koro gɛ a fana dɩfana nyadɩ powu lɛ. Anʋn gɛ taà talɩ tɩ mɛ tɩ tɛ wɔ̀? Tɩ̀ talɩ tɩ tabʋrʋ ma egyu-dɩrɛ abɛɛ bɩtà bʋʋndɩrɛ tɩ tɛ wɔ̀?&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:13">Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛna fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩɩn bɛnɩ bɛɛ nya miin koro ade powu yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa e lila Gehasi alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn nte hiyan gɛtɛ nan mɛ n tɛ wɔ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Gehasi alan, &lt;&lt;To! Ɛn ma ebi, gɛ wɔsan mɔ ɛ dan ditenikwaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Gɛ Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛwʋ bɩrɛ kpèlè wɔ ba!&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Gehasi e kpèlè ɛna fɔ, gɛ e be yela otunu. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" />Gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩkyan-fon, ɔya nyawʋ waanɩ anlɛ, aà ton ebi aalɔ yaanɩ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:16">Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Oo miinfonte! Kara gban mɩ, à di gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Ɔya bɛrɛɛ wʋkɩ wʋʋ gama fɔ, ɛna fɔ e ton diboro, gɛ gɛtɛ gɩkyan gi tuma, ɔya-kɩlɩn wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, e wo ebi-tenibi anlɛ gɛtɛ Elisa ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Ebi fɔ ɛ dan, gɛ ɛ tɔ duwi dɩkɩ ɛ san wote wakʋn. Fɔ wote ɛ̀ sa oli waanɩ ma wɔ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ. <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />Disere-kɩlɩn fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wote alan, &lt;&lt;Agyee, miin duyu! Agyee miin duyu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:19">Gɛ wote ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsaranyan ɛkɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka wɔ sama wɔna!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛsaranyan fɔ e tola ebi fɔ ɛ san ma wɔna. Ebi fɔ ɛ gyaga wɔna wakpin yii koro gɛlɛɛ ma sere gɛtɛ ofila wʋ sara atele, gɛ e ku. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛna fɔ ɛ ka ebi fɔ ɛ bʋn ɛ san Elisa dikwo daanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka wɔ ɛ dʋrɔ wɔ npa wo koro, gɛ ɛ tan dikwo ɛ sa wɔ, gɛ e ye.<verse eid="2KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ e kpèlè wɔsan, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, yɛ aasaranyan fɔ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ dɩkɩ mɔma mɩ nan serenti n san Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ wakʋn nan ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Gɛ wɔsan e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa fɔrɔ wakʋn ǹdò? Ǹdò wuun di gɛ ebon-fon wɔsɛ wuu gedi, gɛ wuun di gɛ duwi-tunalɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:23">Gɛ ɛna fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade ɩkɩ ɩn ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Ɛ pɩna dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsaranyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gyaga dɩkpɔŋɔ fɔ taà san! Kara nya alɛ miin koro fɔ aa yɔlɔ, sɩyɛɛ nmɩ na dɔ̀ wɔ̀ pɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Okoro ɛ tɔ ɛ ma gyu Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ wakʋn, Karimeli wodon wuu koro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:25">Gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ e we ɛna fɔ ɔfɔ fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsaranyan Gehasi alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, Sunami-na fɔ ɛɛ ba! <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Serenti ma tuma wɔ, fɔ àà lila alan, &lt;À si gepe? Asaan è si gepe? Aabi è si gepe?&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:26">Gɛ ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, tɩ̀ si gepe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Gɛtɛ ɛna fɔ e gyu Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ wakʋn, odon fɔ wuu koro fɔ, e gye wɔ bɩsɩrɩ. Gɛ Gehasi ɛ san gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma kpema wɔ ye gama. Mɔ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kere wɔ ya! Ɛ̀ sa dɩkpʋkpʋ daanɩ, mɔ Wurubwarɛ ɛ ka wʋ e bubwa mɩ. Ɛn yɛ mɩ nan nyɩnla ade-kɩlɩn fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Gɛ ɛna fɔ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte, na fɔ wɔ̀ ebi ɛkɩ? Mɩn dɔ̀ wɔ̀ gɛ alɛ kara gban mɩ mɩɩn bʋnʋn bàà gyaga ade ɩkɩ yii koro tuntun?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ Gehasi alan, &lt;&lt;Pɩna koro, fɔ àà ka miinyon-tonlɛ, fɔ àà serenti san. Gengyi à tuma ɛnɩ ɛkɩ fɔ, kara sa wɔ̀ onyun. Gɛ gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ sa wɔ̀ onyun fɔ, kara yera wɔ. À gyu fɔ ka miinyon-tonlɛ fɔ gyaga ebi fɔ bʋnʋn buu koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Mɔ ebi fɔ wɔna ɛ dɔ̀ Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe, gɛ na nya awɔ gbagba alɛ mɩn nan da gɛtɛ an fɩya ma nmɩ.&gt;&gt; Okoro ɛ tɔ ɛ tɛrɛma wɔ ɛ san.<verse eid="2KI 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Gehasi e gyegeye bɛ ɛ ma gyu, gɛ ɛ ka oyon fɔ ɛ gyaga ebi fɔ bʋnʋn buu koro. Mɔ ebi fɔ ɛn tabʋrʋ, gɛ ɛn kya koro. Okoro Gehasi e biri ɛ san ɛ ma tuma Elisa, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ebi fɔ ɛn lama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Gɛtɛ Elisa e gyu dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ fɔ, ebi fɔ e ku ɛ̀ dɔ wɔ npa wo koro. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa e gyu dikwo fɔ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ tan, gɛ e tiri onyun ɛ tɛ Yahwe. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Gɛ ɛ waran ɛ dʋrɔ ebi fɔ wo koro ɛ ka wonyun e ten ma ebi fɔ wonyun, wɔ bʋnʋn bù ten ma ebi fɔ bʋnʋn, walɔ ɩ̀ sa ebi fɔ walɔ yaanɩ. Gɛtɛ Elisa ɛ̀ tʋna ebi fɔ wo koro gɛlɛ fɔ, ebi fɔ wo koro gɩ kya gɛya. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Elisa ɛ tɔ ebi fɔ wo koro, gɛ ɛ̀ san ɛ̀ san ma dikwo fɔ, gɛ e biri ɛ ma dʋrɔ ebi fɔ wo koro. Gɛ ebi fɔ ɛ sɩrɩ disere kwarankɩ, gɛ e tirima bʋnʋn.<verse eid="2KI 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa e kpèlè Gehasi, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kpèlè ebi fɔ wɔna tɛ mɩ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ e kpèlè wɔ. Gɛtɛ ɛna fɔ e be gyu fɔ, Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;To aabi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />E gyu dikwo fɔ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ waran e kura gɛtʋnkwaa Elisa bɩsɩrɩ baanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka wobi, gɛ e ye okòro.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa e biri ɛ mɛ apenterebi-de</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Duwi dɩkɩ, gɛtɛ dɩkpan dɩ nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ powu gaanɩ fɔ, Elisa e biri ɛ san Giligali. Gɛtɛ ee wùlà Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ dikpi bɛkɩ ade fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsaranyan alan, &lt;&lt;Ka gikunbi-dɩrɛ fɔ gyaga, fɔ àà mɛ dabuli tɛ bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Ɛwʋ gɛ, baanɩ ɛkɩ e ye ɛ da dɩfa daanɩ ɛ̀ ma kʋla dɩfa, gɛ e we dɩfa dɩɩ wayɩn. Ɛ ya waabi fɔ ɛ yɔla wɔ gɛgba gii bekotoku baanɩ. Gɛtɛ e biri e be gyu fɔ, e kebi yɩ ɛ sa dabuli gikunbi fɔ gaanɩ, mɔ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn nyɩnla anyan gɛtɛ ì di. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Gɛtɛ bɛ sa bɛnɩ fɔ dabuli fɔ gɛ bee di fɔ, bɛ gbɛrɛ afala alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ, gɛgbɛrɛ gɩ̀ sa dabuli fɔ wanɩ.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɛn talɩ di dabuli fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Gɛ Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ tɛ mɩ ɔnʋmʋ bɛrɛɛ.&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ ka ɔnʋmʋ fɔ ɛ sa gikunbi fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kpà ɩ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bàà di.&gt;&gt;Gɛ ben mini we gɛgbɛrɛ gɩkɩ gikunbi fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa ɛ yɛ bɛnɩ akpilin ton be di anyandilɛ bɛ kʋtɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />Duwi dɩkɩ ete ɛkɩ gɛtɛ e ye Baali-Salisa ditele daanɩ fɔ ɛ ka wanyan-fon yaabi yii beboroboro dikpilin ma anyan-fon yaabi ɛ sa kotoku anɩ, gɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ mɔma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ. Gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsaranyan fɔ alan,&lt;&lt;Yo yɩ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bàà di!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Ɛwʋ gɛ wɔsaranyan fɔ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aa to a di alɛ anyan nyayɩ yaà nɩma nan yo n tɛ bɛnɩ akpilin ton?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:43">Gɛ Elisa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yo yɩ tɛ bɛ bàà di, yema Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alɛ baà di yɩ, gɛtɛ yaà biri i kuruma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Okoro ɛsaranyan fɔ e yo anyandilɛ fɔ ɛ tɛ bɛ, gɛ be di yɩ be kuruma, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Naaman e wura geyeba gɩɩ gɛkya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />Ete ɛkɩ ɛ sara gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ Naaman. È di Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ. Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ ee bù wɔ gepepe, gɛ ee sila wɔ, yema ɛwɔ Naaman wo koro gɛ Yahwe ɛ da, gɛ Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be di akpa yii koro. È di gɛ bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ-dɩrɛ, mɔ ee yeba geyeba-sɩya.<verse eid="2KI 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛɛ tɩ̀ ma kpila Isareli bete baanyan, gɛ waanɩ fɔ, be gye ɛsʋgʋgyan-bi, gɛtɛ ɛ bɛ mɛ Naaman wɔsɔ wɔsʋgʋgyan. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Duwi dɩkɩ ɛsʋgʋgyan-bi fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wofona alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi miinfonte ɛ̀ ka koro ɛ ma wùlà Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa Samariya fɔ, ɛɛ̀ kya wɔ geyeba sɩya nyagɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Gɛtɛ Naaman wɔsɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade nyayɩ fɔ, ɛ san ɛ ma dɔ̀ egyu, ade gɛtɛ Isareli-sʋgʋgyan-bi fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Gɛ Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nʋn, san! Nan tɛ wɔ̀ gɩkpa gɛtɛ aà ka a san ma Isareli wogyu. Okoro Naaman ɛ da. Gɛtɛ ɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ, ɛ ka sɩka-fututu bekilo gɛkpɩn ma akpilin kwarankɩ (340), ma sɩka-sɩya bekilo akpilin asiyee ma fwo (70), ma gèsù gɩɩ ngba akpen fwo (10) e ton. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Gɩkpa gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ san ma Isareli wogyu fɔ gɩɩ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ntɛ sa mɩɩn saranyan Naaman gɛtɛ è de gɩkpa nyagɩ ɛɛ mɔma wɔ̀ lɛ, fɔ àà kya wo geyeba sɩya fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Gɛtɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ bɔ ɛ kalan gɩkpa fɔ, e gye wɔ ngba ɛ fɛɛran, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ di gɛ Wurubwarɛ? Ǹ talɩ n wolo ɛnɩ, abɛɛ ǹ talɩ n birima ɛnɩ n ba nkpa anɩ? Anʋn yii koro gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ nyawɔ ɛɛ ka ɛnɩ ɛ tɩyɛma mɩ alɛ n kya wɔ geyeba sɩya? Nya anlɛ gɛtɛ ee len èè len mɩ ololo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Elisa ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ fɛɛran wɔ ngba fɔ, ɛ sa wɔ ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ a fɛɛran aa ngba. Yɛ ete fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba maakʋn, fɔ èè we alɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ sa Isareli.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Okoro Naaman ɛ ka wabengyi ma wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ, gɛ ɛ ma yela Elisa dɩkpaara diitunu. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa ɛ sa ɛnɩ ɛ ma dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San Yodan getu gaanɩ, fɔ àà kù butu fɔ disere kwarankɩ. Fɔ aa koro-kpaba gaà biri gɩ sara giinundu, gɛ waà kpa wɔ̀ koro dɩdɩɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Mɔ Naaman ɛ ka owurufa e kpe e ye wakʋn gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;I fi ɩ nya! Ǹ nyɩ̀ alɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ eè ye e be yela mɩɩn bʋnʋn, fɔ èè tiri onyun tɛ Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka gʋlɔ wùlà geyeba sɩya fɔ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kya mɩ geyeba fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Damasiko watu Abana ma Faripa ɩn kɔlɔ da Isareli watu powu? Mɩɩn daa kù yaanɩ fɔ nàn wura geyeba gɩɩ gɛkya?&gt;&gt; Okoro Naaman e biri gɛ ɛ da owurufa waanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ wɔ bɛsaranyan be kpe bɛ gbɛma wɔ, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte, Gengyi ade ma ɔkɛma ɩkɩ gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ̀ daà dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alɛ mɛ fɔ, an daà mɛ yɩ? Anʋn yii koro gɛ aan talɩ a bɔ a kù anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, fɔ àà wura geyeba gɩɩ gɛkya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Naaman ɛ waran ɛ san Yodan getu fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ e gyu butu fɔ baanɩ e mulun e ye disere kwarankɩ, anlɛ gɛtɛ Elisa e wùlà wɔ fɔ, gɛ e wura geyeba gɩɩ gɛkya. Wo koro gi biri gi sara giinundu gɛ gi fere anlɛ ebi-sorobi wo koro-kpaba. <verse eid="2KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Naaman ma wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ powu be biri bɛ san Elisa wakʋn, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nkele na we gɛtɛ gɛtʋnkwaa powu gaanɩ fɔ Wurubwarɛ ɛn ma ɔkankɩ sɩyɛɛ Isareli. Okoro ɛndɩrɛ, ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ to aasaranyan anyan-kyɛlɛ nyayɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa, gɛ ntɛ sʋma lɛ alɛ, mɩn nan to anyan-kyɛlɛ ɩkɩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:16">Naaman ɛ nyɩ Elisa gɛtɛ èè to anyan fɔ, mɔ Elisa e terema. <verse eid="2KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Naaman alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi an nan to maanyan-kyɛlɛ fɔ bɩrɛ fɔ, yɛ nmɩ aasaranyan nan kpila atɩn akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ yaatola anyɔɔ n san mɩɩnlɛ n ma mara gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn, yema ye nkenkele san fɔ, mɩn nan nɩ tɛ ekpen ɛkɩ gedi, abɛɛ nan kuma anyan n tɛ ekpen ɛkɩ gedi, sɩyɛɛ Yahwe woko.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ miinfonte ee gyu ekpen Rimon dikwo daanɩ èè kura wɔ fɔ, ɛɛ tɩ̀ ka ɔdʋrʋ ɛ nyɩ mɩ gɛtɛ wʋʋ yɛ nmɩ mɔ nte kura wɔ. Mɔ ntɛ fɔ Yahwe ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka nmɩ aasaranyan maade-kpen gɛtɛ na mɛ fɔ ɛ kyɛ mɩ. Ntɛ fɔ Yahwe ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka ɛ kyɛ mɩ yema nmɩ mɔ na kura na sʋma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San olila waanɩ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:19">Gɛtɛ Naaman e kpe e ye Elisa wakʋn ɛ da gɛ ɛn ta ye ɔfɔ gʋsɔ fɔ, <verse eid="2KI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" />Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Elisa wɔsaranyan Gehasi ɛ dɔ̀ woko-woko alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte e kere Aram-te Naaman nyawɔ ɛ ya ɛ da gɛtɛ en to wanyan gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ ba fɔ. Na nya Yahwe alɛ nan serenti n tɛrɛma wɔ n ma to gɩnyankɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Gɛ Gehasi ɛ kpa ɛ gyaga Naaman wo koro. Gɛtɛ Naaman e we Gehasi è serenti ɛ̀ tɛrɛma wɔ fɔ, ɛ waran wo tiiramisan fɔ wo koro ɛ ma tuma wɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade ɩkɩ ɩ ba abɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Gɛ Gehasi alan, &lt;&lt;Ade kpen ɩkɩ ɩn ma. Miinfonte na sa mɩ aakʋn alɛ ǹ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ bɛnyɔɔ be ye Efrayim wo-idon yɩɩ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ bɛ ba maakʋn nkenkele nyawʋ. Ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ tɛ bɛ sɩka-fututu bekilo dikpilin ma fwo bɛnaa, ma ngba akpen bʋnyɔɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Gɛ Naaman ɛ dɔ̀ Gehasi alan, &lt;&lt;To sɩka-fututu fɔ bekilo akpilin asiyee ma nɩyɛ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ nyɩ̀ wɔ gɛtɛ e to wʋ gɛlɛ, gɛ ɛ ban sɩka-fututu fɔ ɛ sa bɛbagɩ bɛnyɔɔ baanɩ, fɩya ma ngba fɔ. Gɛ Naaman ɛ ka anyɩmɩnyan fɔ e tola wɔ bɛsaranyan bɛnyɔɔ bɛ ka bɛ ma yela Gehasi. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Gɛtɛ be gyu odon wuu koro fɔ, Gehasi e to anyɩmɩnyan fɔ ɛ ma sɩ̀ wo dikwo daanɩ, gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛnɩ fɔ be biri bɛ da. <verse eid="2KI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Ɛwʋ gɛ e gyu ɛ san ɛ ma yela wofonte bʋnʋn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:25">Gɛ Elisa e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gaanɩ gɛ a san?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Gehasi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn san ɔkankɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Mɔ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;À nyɩ̀ alɛ ete fɔ ɛ waran e ye wo tiiramisan fɔ wanɩ e be tuma wɔ̀ fɔ miin sunsun ɛn fɩya ma awɔ? Ɔya nyawʋ gɛ aa ka a to kɔba, abɛɛ aa ka a to ngba, ma olife wo-iyon, ma olife wo-ili, ma bɛnan, ma bɛyɛran, abɛɛ bɛdɩ̀-teni ma bɛdɩ̀-nanɩ? <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Ade nyayɩ gɛtɛ a mɛ lɛ yii koro, Naaman geyeba-sɩya fɔ gaà gye awɔ ma aadu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Gehasi e kpe e ye Elisa bʋnʋn. Geyeba-sɩya gi gye wɔ, gɛ e fo anlɛ ɔyangʋ.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Dɩkyɔɔ dii dibi dɩ bʋn dɩ bɛ gyaga butu buu koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Duwi dɩkɩ Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ dikpi fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ tii tuma ma awɔ fɔ, wù we pɩɩ gʋsɔ tɛ tɩ. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Yɛ taà san Yodan getu gaanɩ taà ma kebi iyon dʋkɔ, fɔ taà sere taasarakʋn dʋkɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:2">Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ san.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ baanɩ ɛkɩ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, an nan fɩya ma ɛtɩ aa bɛsaranyan a san?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:3">Gɛ Elisa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Nan fɩya ma ɛyɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />Gɛ ɛ fɩya ma ɛbɛ ɛ san.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:4">Bɛ san bɛ ma gyu Yodan, gɛ bɛ kya iyon yii gekebi. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Gɛtɛ baanɩ ɛkɩ ee kebi oyon fɔ, wɔ dɩkyɔɔ dii dibi, gɛtɛ dì di gɩwɔrɔnyan fɔ dɩ kpa di gyu butu baanɩ. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, miinfonte! Na fɔ dɩ gɛ! <verse eid="2KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Gɛ Elisa e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ganɩ gɛ dɩ nʋ̀n?&gt;&gt; Gɛtɛ e wùlà wɔ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ dɩ nʋ̀n di gyu fɔ, Elisa e len oyon-bi, gɛ e fun wʋ ɛ sa dʋkɔ, gɛ wʋ yɛ dɩkyɔɔ dii dibi fɔ dɩ bʋn dɩ bɛ gyaga gatala disere-kɩlɩn. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Kukuru dɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ete ɛ sama gʋlɔ e kukuru dɩ.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa ɛ yɛ Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn bu gbena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Waanɩ fɔ Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛɛ tà bɩtà ma Isareli. Gengyi ee tuma ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ, ɛɛ dɔ̀ bɛ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ è len gɛtɛ èè sere wɔ gɛsarakʋn.<verse eid="2KI 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Mɔ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ sa Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Nya gepe gɛtɛ an nan da ma ɔkʋn wʋtɔkɔ, yema Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛɛ waran bɛɛ fɔrɔ dʋkɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Okoro Isareli wogyu ɛɛ dɩyɛ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ gepepe. Elisa ɛɛ tɩ̀ yɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛɛ nyɩnla ade nyayɩ disere kpekpesi, gɛtɛ wʋʋ yɛ wɔ ɛɛ dɩyɛ ɩkʋn ɩtɔkɔ.<verse eid="2KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Wʋ yɛ Aram bete boogyu-dɩrɛ wamɩnlɛ i tutu. Okoro e kpèlè wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ e tuma, gɛ e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Yaà talɩ ɩ dɔ̀ mɩ taanɩ gɛtɛ è yela Isareli wogyu gama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Gɛ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Nka taanɩ ɛkɩ, miinfonte. Wù di gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Elisa gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa Isareli fɔ n tɛ dɔ̀ ade gbagba gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ fɔ ɛ tɛ Isareli wogyu. Gengyi wu terema wù di gɛ aa dikwo-dʋrɔlɛ daanɩ gɛ a dɔ̀ yɩ gba fɔ, ee we yɩ ɛ dɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Gɛ Aram wogyu alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ san ɩ ma bugiti wɔ, fɔ nan wura n sa bɛnɩ bàà ma gye wɔ. Gɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ ɛ̀ sa Dotan ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma abengyi ma betiiramisan ditele fɔ daanɩ. Bɛ ma gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ odente, gɛ bɛ sʋ dɩ bɛ sa.<verse eid="2KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Gɛtɛ kere gɩ kpa fɔ, Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ wɔsaranyan ɛ tɔ gagyɩgyan-fuu e ye okòro, gɛ e we bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma abengyi, ma tiiramisan ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be silin ditele fɔ be tuma. Gɛ wɔsaranyan fɔ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, miinfonte, lan gɛ taà mɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton wɔ̀! Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛtɩ fɔ bɛ̀ sɔ da ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Gɛ Elisa e tiri onyun alan, &lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe, tirima wɔ bʋnʋn, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ talɩ we! Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe e tirima wɔsaranyan fɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ nya, gɛ e we gɛtɛ idon gɛtɛ i silin Elisa fɔ i to ma abengyi, ma betiiramisan gɛtɛ ɔtan wuu gye ma ɛyɩ.<verse eid="2KI 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Gɛtɛ Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ ka osele bɛɛ ba Elisa wakʋn fɔ, Elisa e tiri onyun alan, &lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe, yɛ bɛnɩ nyabɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn bàà gbena.&gt;&gt; Okoro Yahwe ɛ yɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn bu gbena, anlɛ gɛtɛ Elisa e lila fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nka osele wʋ lɛ, gɛ nka ditele fɔ dɩ lɛ. I tɛrɛma mɩ, fɔ nan ka yɩ n san ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ii bugiti fɔ wakʋn.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ ka bɛ ɛ san Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Gɛtɛ be gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ fɔ, Elisa e tiri onyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe, tirima bɛnɩ nyabɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn, fɔ bàà we!&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn bu tirima, gɛ be we gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Samariya ditele daanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Gɛtɛ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ e we bɛ fɔ, e lila Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Miinte, n wolo bɛ abɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Gɛ Elisa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa! Aà wolo bɛnɩ gɛtɛ a ka awɔ gbagba aadon ma aa gɩsɩnta a gye bɛ bɩtà fɔ? Tɛ bɛ anyandilɛ ma butu bàà di, fɔ bàà nyʋn, fɔ bàà biri san boofonte wakʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Okoro Isareli wogyu ɛ yɛ be di ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ. Gɛ gɛtɛ be di, gɛ bɛ nyʋn be were fɔ, e tiri bɛ osele. Ye dʋkɔ fɔ, Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be ten anyan yii gekpila ye Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be len be silin Samariya ditele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Ɔya wʋkɩ wʋʋ gama fɔ, Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ Ben-Hadadi ɛ kʋla wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ powu, gɛ bɛ san bɛ ma sʋ Samariya ditele bɛ sa. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Dɩkpan dɩ nʋ̀n ditele fɔ daanɩ. Ditele fɔ dɩɩ gɛsʋ-sa gɩ kyɛrɩ gɛtɛ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ gba dii duyu dɩɩ gɩyɛ gɩ̀ ba sɩka-fututu abi dikpilin ma anaa (80). Gɛ ɛlɔpɔ wapʋn kɔpʋ yɩɩ gɩyɛ n di sɩka-fututu wabi ton.<verse eid="2KI 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Duwi dɩkɩ, gɛtɛ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ san ɔpɔrɩ wuu koro ɛɛ da fɔ, ɛna ɛkɩ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala e kpèlè wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ, kpà mɩ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi Yahwe ɛn kpà wɔ̀ fɔ, gaanɩ gɛ nmɩ nan wura gɛkpà n ye alɛ ntɛ kpà wɔ̀? Nan wura gɩ n ye amɔrɔ yii getibakʋn abɛɛ wayɩn gɛnyɩmakʋn? <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ e lila ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn n de wɔ̀?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:28">Gɛ ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛna nyawɔ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;Ka aabi-teni fɔ ba tàà kɔrɔ wɔ ǹdò, fɔ tàà kɔrɔ miinyo gɩsa.&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" />Okoro tɩ gyaga miinbi-teni fɔ tɩ kɔrɔ. Wuu kere gɩ kpa fɔ, na dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;Ka aabi-teni fɔ ba tàà kɔrɔ.&gt; Mɔ ɛ ka wɔ e bubwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ nʋn ɛna fɔ wanyun-gyebi e were fɔ, e gye wɔ ngba ɛ fɛɛran. Gɛtɛ ɛ̀ san ɔpɔrɩ wuu koro fɔ, bɛnɩ bɛ nya, gɛ be we gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa disepekyi dɩɩ gɛgba wɔ ngba fɔ bʋʋ gatɩn. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi min belen Safati wobi Elisa duyu ǹdò fɔ, Wurubwarɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ mɩ e wolo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Waanɩ fɔ, Elisa è si wo dikwo daanɩ ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi. Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa ɛnɩ ɛkɩ e gyegeye wɔ, mɔ pɛ ɛnɩ fɔ èè be gyu Elisa wakʋn fɔ, Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ alan, bɛnɩ boowololɛ nyawɔ ɛ sa ɛnɩ alɛ e be belen mɩ duyu. Ɩ nya, gengyi è bè gyu fɔ, ɩ tan ɔpʋnʋ fɔ gɛtɛ ɛ kara wura e gyu. Yaà nʋn wɔ bɩsɩrɩ baagingin gɛtɛ ɛ̀ tɛrɛma wɔsalɛ fɔ ɛɛ ba.<verse eid="2KI 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Gɛtɛ Elisa ɛ̀ sangba ɛɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ, ɛsalɛ fɔ e be gyu wakʋn. Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gyerebi nyawɔ e ye gɛ Yahwe wakʋn. Wù di tuntun gɛtɛ nan ka bʋnʋn n gyaga wo koro alɛ n te so wɔ.<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nʋn Yahwe wanyun-gyebi. Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩsa gagyɩgyan, ɔkʋna nyawʋ anlɛ, baà fu ɔnʋmʋ mudu bɛnyɔɔ sɩka-fututu dibi-kɩlɩn. Gɛ baà fu amɔrɔ yɩɩnʋmʋ mudu bɛnyɔɔ sɩka-fututu dibi-kɩlɩn Samariya ditele dii getumakʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ wɔndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ ɛɛ kpà wɔ fɔ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Nya! Gengyi Wurubwarɛ e terema ɛ tana gatala gba, gɛ anyan yaabi i ye gatala ɩ bɛ nʋ̀n fɔ, ade nyayɩ gɛtɛ aa dɔ̀ lɛ yaà talɩ ɩ ba waanɩ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 7:2">Elisa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ gbagba aà ka aa gʋnʋn a we, mɔ an nan di yɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Be kere ditele fɔ dɩɩ gɛsʋ-sa bɛ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />Waanɩ fɔ, beteni bɛnaa bɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee yeba geyeba-sɩya fɔ bè sì ditele fɔ diitunu okòro. Bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ tɛ bɛwɔlɔn alan, anʋn yii koro gɛ taà sara nfan gɛlɛɛ ka ma sere gɛtɛ taà ka ti ku? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Gengyi tɩ̀ dɔ̀ alɛ, &lt;Taà gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ oo, dɩkpan fɔ dɩ̀ sa dʋkɔ okoro taà ku.&gt; Gɛ gengyi tɩ̀ dɔ̀ alɛ taà kʋn tɩ sara nfan fɔ, taà ku. Okoro taà san Aram bete bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn gaanɩ, fɔ taà ma ka koro tɩ tɛ bɛ. Gengyi bè kere tɩ bɛ ya fɔ, taà sara nkpa. Mɔ gengyi bè wolo tɩ fɔ, ti ku, fɔ wu were.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Okoro, gɛtɛ ofila wuu gyu fɔ, bɛ tɔ bɛ bʋn bɛ da Aram bete bɔ gɛsarakʋn gaanɩ. Gɛtɛ be gyu gɛsarakʋn fɔ giikere fɔ, ɛnɩ n di ɛnɩ ɛn ma dʋkɔ. <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />Yema Efonte ɛ yɛ Aram bete bɛ nʋn ade ɩkɩ baaten yaanɩ anlɛ tiiramisan ɛbɛ, ma abengyi, ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ-dɩrɛ baagingin. Okoro bɛ dɔ̀ bɛwɔlɔn alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya, Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ma hayɩ Hiti bete, ma Egyipiti bete boo begyu gɛtɛ bàà bɛ̀ tà tɩ bɩtà!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Be kere baasarakʋn bɛ ya anlɛ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ fʋrʋma wù we, gɛ be serenti bɛ da bàà ka wura nkpa. Be serenti be kere bàà baabengyi, ma baakpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ bɛ ya.<verse eid="2KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Gɛtɛ geyeba-sɩya gii bete bɛnaa fɔ be gyu gɛsarakʋn fɔ giikere fɔ, be gyu dɩyan-kwo fɔ dɩkɩ daanɩ, be di, gɛ bɛ nyʋn, ge be tola sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya, ma ngba bɛ ma bubwa. Be biri bɛ san bɛ ma gyu dɩyan-kwo-do daanɩ, gɛ bɛ ka anyɩmɩnyan ɩkɩ be ye daanɩ bɛ ma bubwa ke.<verse eid="2KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Dʋkɔ fɔ, bɛ dɔ̀ bɛwɔlɔn alan, &lt;&lt;Ade gɛtɛ tɩɩ mɛ lɛ ɩn kɔlɔ. Ǹdò wuu duwi nyadɩ dì di gɛ ade-kpara yii duwi, okoro wuun di gɛtɛ taà ka tɩ mɛ tiiko taade. Gengyi tì so ma ye gɛgyɩgyan pɛgɛ tɩ̀ dɔ̀ ade nyayɩ fɔ, taà wura giten-tiira. Ɩ yɛ tàà san digyu-kpaara taà ma dɔ̀ bɛ nkenkele nyawʋ. <verse eid="2KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ ma dɔ̀ otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩ san Aram bete bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn gaanɩ, mɔ tin we ɛnɩ ɛkɩ, gɛ tɩn nʋn ɛnɩ ɛkɩ wo koro. Abengyi ma akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ ì yela gɛtɛ ben furu yɩ, gɛ ayan-kwo fɔ ɩ̀ bɔ ì we anlɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ tɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ bɛ yasɩ ade fɔ, bɛ ma dɔ̀ yɩ digyu-kpaara.<verse eid="2KI 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɔ odente, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi alan, &lt;&lt;Nan dɔ̀ yɩ ade gɛtɛ Aram bete bee len bàà mɛ tɩ. Gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ tii ku dɩkpan okoro, be ye bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn fɔ bàà ma bu dɩfa daanɩ ɔkankɩ. Bɛɛ nya gɛtɛ gengyi tì ye tii ditele daanɩ tɩ ma bugiti anyandilɛ fɔ, baà gye tɩ gʋnʋn-ŋɔrɔ fɔ bàà gyu tii ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Mɔ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ tàà sa bɛnɩ bɛkɩ bàà ka abengyi ton gɛtɛ i kuruma ditele daanɩ fɔ bàà ma nya alɛ anʋn na sere. Gengyi bɛ san gɛ be wura nkpa fɔ, bɛ bɔ be we anlɛ Isareli bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be si nkpa fɔ. Gɛ gengyi bè ku mɔ fɔ, bɛn da ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be were ku fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ be tiri bɛnɩ bɛkɩ, gɛ egyu ɛ yɛ ka tiiramisan ɛbɛ bɛnyɔɔ ma baabengyi, gɛ ɛ sa bɛ alɛ bɛ san bɛ ma nya alɛ anʋn na sere Aram bete boo koro. <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Okoro bɛ san gɛlɛɛ bɛ ma gyu Yodan. Gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san osele waanɩ powu fɔ, be we gɛtɛ Aram bete bɔɔ ngba ma anyan i ye ɩ nʋ̀n-nʋ̀n ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bee serenti fɔ. Okoro bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ sa fɔ be biri bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ egyu fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Samariya bete bɛ san Aram bete bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn bɛ ma kpila baanyɩmɩnyan. Gɛ be fu ɔnʋmʋ mudu bɛnyɔɔ sɩka-fututu dibi-kɩlɩn. Gɛ be fu amɔrɔ yɩɩnʋmʋ mudu bɛnyɔɔ sɩka-fututu dibi-kɩlɩn anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu e tiri wɔndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ ɛɛ kpà wɔ fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ èè yela ditele fɔ diitunu. Mɔ bɛnɩ be kyikya wɔ otunu fɔ dʋkɔ be wolo anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu fɔ ɛ ba Elisa wakʋn gɛ ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Wʋ ba waanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ Elisa ɛ tɩ̀ dɔ̀ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩsa ɔkʋna nyawʋ anlɛ, baà fu ɔnʋmʋ mudu bɛnyɔɔ sɩka-fututu dibi-kɩlɩn, gɛ baà fu amɔrɔ yɩɩnʋmʋ mudu bɛnyɔɔ sɩka-fututu dibi-kɩlɩn Samariya getumakʋn.&gt;&gt;fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />Ɛndɩrɛbi fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya! Gengyi Wurubwarɛ e terema ɛ tana gatala gba, gɛ anyan yaabi i ye gatala ɩ bɛ nʋ̀n fɔ, ade nyayɩ gɛtɛ aa dɔ̀ lɛ yaà talɩ ɩ ba waanɩ?&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ gbagba aà ka aa gʋnʋn a we, mɔ an nan di yɩ. <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Gɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, gɛlɛ gɛ wʋ mɛ wɔ, bɛnɩ bɛ kyikya wɔ ditele fɔ diitunu be wolo.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Sunami-na fɔ e biri ɛ san wɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />Gɛtɛ Elisa ɛ lama ɛna gɛtɛ e ye Sunami fɔ wobi fɔ e were fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ ma aa dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ ɩ tɔ ye nfan fɔ yàà ma sara ɔkʋn-fon, yema Yahwe ɛɛ̀ bɛ̀ yɛ dɩkpan dàà nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro bɩkyan kwarankɩ. <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Okoro ɛna fɔ ɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ. Ɛwɔ ma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ tɔ gɛ bɛ ma sara Filisiti bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ bɩkyan kwarankɩ. <verse eid="2KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Gɛtɛ bɩkyan kwarankɩ fɔ bu were fɔ, e biri e ye Filisiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ ɛ ba Isareli, gɛ ɛ ma fɔ egyu fɔ gɛtɛ bàà birima wɔ dɩkpaara ma wɔ gɛtʋnkwaa bɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Gɛtɛ ɛ san fɔ, egyu fɔ ɛɛ tabʋrʋ ma Gehasi gɛtɛ è di Elisa wɔsaranyan fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ mɩ ade-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Elisa ɛ mɛ powu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Gɛtɛ Gehasi ɛ̀ bɔ ɛɛ dɔ̀ egyu fɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ Elisa ɛ lama ɛna gɛtɛ wobi e ku fɔ ɛ ba nkpa anɩ fɔ, ɛna fɔ gɛtɛ Elisa ɛ lama wobi e ye diku daanɩ fɔ na be ye dʋkɔbɛ, ɛ̀ bɛ fɔ egyu fɔ èè birima wɔ dɩkpaara ma wɔ gɛtʋnkwaa ɛ tɛ wɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:5">Gehasi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛna fɔ wɔ lɛ, miinfonte egyu, gɛ wobi gɛtɛ Elisa ɛ lama e ye diku daanɩ ɛ ba nkpa waanɩ fɔ wɔ lɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Egyu fɔ e lila ɛna fɔ ade fɔ, gɛ ɛna fɔ dɔ̀ wɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:6">Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu fɔ e kpèlè wɔndɩrɛbi ɛkɩ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Birima gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gì di woyo fɔ tɛ wɔ, ma sɩka-kamasɛ gɛtɛ wu ye woli waanyan yaanɩ wʋ ba, ye duwi gɛtɛ e ye gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ gaanɩ bè sere ma ǹdò fɔ powu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hasayeli e wolo Ben-Hadadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />Elisa ɛ san Damasiko, fɔ Aram wogyu Ben-Hadadi ee yeba. Gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Elisa ɛ ba nfan&gt;&gt; fɔ, <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />ɛ dɔ̀ Hasayeli alan, &lt;&lt;Ka anyan-kyɛlɛ, fɔ àà san màà tama Wurubwarɛ-wɔnɩ, fɔ àà fɔ wɔ, fɔ èè lila Yahwe alan, &lt;Nan tɔ n ye miin geyeba nyagɩ gaanɩ?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hasayeli ɛ ka akpɔŋɔ akpilin anyɔɔ, gɛ ɛ ka anyan-kpara-kpara-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Damasiko fɔ e tola aakpɔŋɔ fɔ, gɛ ɛ san Elisa wakʋn. Gɛtɛ e gyu wakʋn fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aasaranyan Ben-Hadadi, gɛtɛ e di Aram wogyu fɔ na sa mɩ alɛ n be lila wɔ̀ alan, &lt;Nan tɔ n ye miin geyeba nyagɩ gaanɩ?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Gɛ Elisa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe e tiri e wùlà mɩ alɛ eè ku, mɔ san ma dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ ɛɛ̀ tɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa e sere bʋnʋn ɛɛ nya Hasayeli gɛlɛɛ, gɛtɛ wʋ yɛ Hasayeli bʋnʋn bu ku. Gɛ Elisa e gbena ɛ sa ee wula. <verse eid="2KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hasayeli e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte anʋn yii koro gɛ aa wula?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Elisa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yema ǹ nyɩ gyerebi gɛtɛ aà yɛ wàà nʋ̀n Isareli bete boo koro. Aà kuma baatele gɛtɛ bɛ mara ɩpɔrɩ bɛ sa yɩ fɔ, aà ka tata a wolo bɔɔ bɛsaranyan, aà fun bɔɔ bɛkyʋkyʋʋ a fɩna gɛtʋnkwaa a wolo, gɛ boo beborona baaboro yaà ye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hasayeli ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Waà mɛ lan gɛ nmɩ aasaranyan gɛtɛ miin di gɩnyankɩ lɛ nan talɩ n mɛ gʋtʋn-dɩrɛ nyagɩ gaakɩ?&gt;&gt; Mɔ Elisa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe e tiri e wùlà mɩ alɛ awɔ aà bɛ mɛ Aram wogyu,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Gɛ Hasayeli e ye Elisa wakʋn, gɛ e biri ɛ da wofonte waakʋn. Gɛ Ben-Hadadi e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Lan gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Hasayeli e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ aà nyɩ a tɔ a ye geyeba fɔ gaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Mɔ duwi-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ ɛ ka dɩyan ma otin ɛ nyɔ butu, gɛ ɛ ka dɩ ɛ ma yɛrɛba e tin egyu fɔ bʋnʋn, okoro e ku. Gɛ Hasayeli e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="2KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />Isareli wogyu Ahabi wobi Yoram gɩkyan-tonfɛ gaanɩ, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yehosafati è di Yuda wogyu fɔ, Yehosafati wobi Yehoram e sere ɔpɩ ee di bugyu Yuda gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yehoram e di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-bʋnyɔɔ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan nɩyɛ. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Yehoram mɔ ɛ mɛ gɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Isareli begyu bɛ mɛ fɔ. Gɛ ɛ mɛ duyu-kɛma anlɛ egyu Ahabi, yema e to Ahabi wobi-nanɩ ɛkɩ gɩna. Okoro Yehoram ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" />Mɔ fɔ, Yahwe ɛn taa len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɩna Yuda, yema ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ Dafidi alɛ wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ nan bɔ be di bugyu gakpaakpa. <verse eid="2KI 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />Yehoram wɔya waanɩ fɔ, Edom bete bɛ tɔ be yela Yuda gɩfɩɩ gii koro, gɛ bɛ sɩ̀ ɛbɛ gbagba boogyu. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Okoro Yehoram ɛ ka wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ powu bɛ san Sayiri. Gɛ Edom bete bɛ sʋ ɛwɔ ma wotiiramisan ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ sa. Mɔ ɛwɔ ma wotiiramisan ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ tɔ be serenti odonte, gɛ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛ yasɩ bɛ da bɔɔ-ɩlɛ <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Ye dʋwi dɩtɔkɔ fɔ, Edom bɛnɩ be to koro be ye Yuda gatɩn. Gɛlɛ wʋʋ ya wʋtɔkɔ ke waanɩ gɛ Libina ditele mɔ di to koro di ye Yuda gatɩn. <verse eid="2KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Gɛ bɛ ŋwara Yehoram wade-mɛlɛ kurumakyɛɛ ma wo bugyu buuyo powu bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehoram e ku gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɩsan baanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Dafidi Ditele fɔ. Gɛ wobi Ahasiya e di bugyu ɛ sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahasiya e di bugyu Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />Isareli wogyu Ahabi wobi-teni Yoram gɩkyan fwo-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Yuda wogyu Yehoram wobi Ahasiya e sere ɔpɩ ee di bugyu. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Ahasiya e di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma bʋnyɔɔ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem gɩkyan-kɩlɩn. Wɔna n di Ataliya gɛtɛ e di Isareli wogyu Omiri wɔnana fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Ahasiya ɛ mɛ wade anlɛ Ahabi dɩkpaara, gɛ ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ Ahabi dɩkpaara dɩ mɛ fɔ. Yema e to ɛna e ye Ahabi dɩkpaara daanɩ gɛ ɛ ka koro ɛ fɩya ma ɛbɛ. <verse eid="2KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Ahasiya ɛ ka wo koro ɛ ma fɩya ma Ahabi wobi Yoram bàà ma kpà ma Aram wogyu Haseli, Ramoti-Gileyadi gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ, gɛ Aram bete be pira Yoram. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro egyu Yoram e biri ɛ san Yesereli ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma nyɩ waakʋn gɛtɛ e wura e ye ɛbɛ ma Ramoti bete baakpà yaanɩ fɔ. Gɛ Yuda wogyu Yehoram wobi Ahasiya ɛ san ɛ ma nya wɔ.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yehu e di bugyu Isareli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Duwi dɩkɩ Yahwe wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Elisa e kpèlè ɛtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ e ye Yahwe bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ baanɩ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Li aa gɛgba gɛtɩɩ, fɔ àà ka parantʋwa gɛtɛ bʋnɔ bʋ̀ sa waanɩ fɔ ton, fɔ àà san Ramoti Gileyadi. <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />Gengyi àà ma gyu dʋkɔ fɔ, bugiti Yehosafati wobi-teni Yehu gɛtɛ è di Nimsi wɔnana fɔ. Kpèlè wɔ ye wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ baanɩ san dikwo daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />Fɔ àà ka parantʋwa fɔ àà da bʋnɔ fɔ lù wo diyu dii koro fɔ àà dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, Na sʋrʋ wɔ̀ bʋnɔ àà be di bugyu Isareli.&gt; Fɔ àà tana dɩtana fɔ àà serenti ye dʋkɔ bilenten.<verse eid="2KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Okoro ɛsaranyan fɔ, gɛtɛ è di Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ wɔsaranyan fɔ, ɛ san Ramoti Gileyadi. <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Gɛtɛ ɛ ma gyu fɔ, e we bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ be tuma bè sɩ̀, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ baanɩ ɛkɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ ba ɔtʋn tɛ wɔ̀, ɛndɩrɛ.&gt;&gt;Gɛ Yehu e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Taanɩ ɛ̀ mɔmɔ?&gt;&gt;Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">&lt;&lt;Awɔ, ɛndɩrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro, Yehu ɛ tɔ, gɛ ɛ da dɩkpaara. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ dà bʋnɔ fɔ e lù Yehu diyu dii koro gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubuarɛ alan, &lt;Na sere wɔ̀ bugyu na tɛ Wurubwarɛ bɛnɩ, Isareli bete. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />Wù di gɛtɛ àà muru aafonte Ahabi dɩkpaara. Gɛlɛ wuusele gɛ nan ka n tiira Yesebeli giten gɛtɛ e wolo mɩɩn bɛtabʋrʋlɛ ma Yahwe bɛsʋmalɛ powu fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />Wù di gɛtɛ Ahabi dɩkpaara powu dàà muru. Nan wolo Ahabi dɩkpaara diibi-teni-kamasɛ, bɛdɩ ma bengyebi powu n ye Isareli. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Nan mɩna Ahabi dɩkpaara anlɛ gɛtɛ na mɩna Nebati wobi Yerobowam ma Ahiya wobi Baasa baa-kpaara fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" />Gɛ bɛkpɛɛ nan kɔrɔ Yesebeli Yesereli gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro, gɛ ɛkɩ ɛn nan lò wɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ tana dɩtana fɔ, gɛ e serenti. <verse eid="2KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Gɛtɛ Yehu e biri ɛ san wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ fɔ baakʋn fɔ, baanɩ ɛkɩ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade ɩkɩ ɩ ba abɛɛ? Anʋn gɛ ɛbalanɩ nyawɔ ee len aakʋn?&gt;&gt;Yehu e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;À nyɩ ete fɔ, ma wade dɔ̀lɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aa gban gɛ. Dɔ̀ tɩ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa waanɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yehu ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ n di alan, Yahwe alan, Na sere wɔ̀ bugyu Isareli.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Gɛ disere-kɩlɩn fɔ, Yehu wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ fɔ bɛ yɛraba baayan bɛ sɩ̀ wɔ bɩsɩrɩ bʋʋ gatɩn. Bɛ fʋ̀n dɩkantan gɛ bɛ gbɛrɛ afala bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yehu è di egyu&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehu e wolo Yoram ma Ahasiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehosafati wobi Yehu gɛtɛ è di Nimsi wɔnana fɔ, ɛ ka amɩnlɛ alɛ eè wolo Yoram. <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" />Mɔ fɔ, be pira Yoram akpa fɔ yaanɩ, gɛ e biri ɛ ba Yesereli ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ kya wo koro geyeba. Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yehu ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi gɛlɛ gɛ wʋʋ mɛ wɔ fɔ, kara tɛ osele ɛnɩ kɩlɩn ɛ̀ɛ̀ sarɩ ye dɩtele fɔ daanɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma dɔ̀ ade fɔ Yesereli ditele.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ bʋn ɛ sara wo tiiramisan waanɩ gɛ ɛ da Yesereli, yema Yoram ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ ee tuna, gɛ Yuda wogyu Ahasiya ɛ da dʋkɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma nya wɔ. <verse eid="2KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛdɩyɛlɛ gɛtɛ è yela Yesereli dikwo ma abo fɔ dii koro fɔ e we Yehu ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛɛ ba, gɛ e kpen alan, &lt;&lt;Na we bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛkɩ bɛɛ ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:17">Gɛ Yoram ɛ fa alan, &lt;&lt;Sa dibengyi dɩɩsaralɛ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma lila bɛ alɛ bɛɛ ba olila waanɩ abɛɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Okoro dibengyi dɩɩsaralɛ fɔ ɛ ma tuma Yehu gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan,&lt;&lt;Egyu ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ nyɩnla alɛ ɩɩ ba olila waanɩ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Gɛ Yehu e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛwʋ wun di aade. Tɛ mɩ osele.&gt;&gt;Ɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Dibengyi dɩɩsaralɛ fɔ ɛ ma gyu baakʋn, mɔ ɛn taa ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Okoro egyu ɛ sa dibengyi dɩɩsaralɛ-nyɔɔfɛ. Gɛtɛ ɛ ma gyu baakʋn fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ nyɩnla alɛ ɩɩ ba olila waanɩ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yehu e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛwʋ wun di aade. Tɛ mɩ osele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Ɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ ɛ nɩ dɔ̀ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Dibengyi dɩɩsaralɛ fɔ ɛ ma gyu baakʋn, ɛwɔ mɔ ɛn taa ba. Ɛnɩ gɛtɛ è gyegeye bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ ɛɛ kya tiiramisan fɔ anlɛ ɛbalanɩ. Bɔɔ ka nya Nimisi wobi Yehu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yoram ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ pɩna mɩɩn tiiramisan fɔ ɩ tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt;Gɛtɛ bɛ pɩna tiiramisan fɔ be were fɔ, Isareli wogyu, ma Yuda wogyu Ahasiya bɛ ka ɛkamasɛ ma wo tiiramisan, bàà ma tuma Yehu. Be tuma wɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ gì di Yesereli-te Naboti woyo fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Gɛtɛ Yoram e we Yehu fɔ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yehu, à ba olila waanɩ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:22">Gɛ Yehu e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ aana Yesebeli bekpen ma wɔ gʋsɔ ɩ̀ sa ma ɛtɩ lɛ, lan gɛ olila waà talɩ wʋ sara? <verse eid="2KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Yoram ɛ dɔ̀ Ahasiya alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛ gban tɩ&gt;&gt; gɛ e fi wo tiiramisan, gɛ e serenti. <verse eid="2KI 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehu e tiri wɔ gyangarɩ, gɛ e tiira wʋ kin-kin e sere Yoram wagongyi yii getite. Gɛ gɩsɩnta fɔ gɩ ma sere woturu waanɩ, gɛ ɛ nʋ̀n ɛ kpasa wo tiiramisan fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Gɛ Yehu ɛ dɔ̀ wɔndɩrɛbi Bidika alan, &lt;&lt;Ka wo gikpena fɔ fun fɩna Yesereli-te Naboti gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ gaanɩ. Kʋna gɛtɛ ɛtɩ ma awɔ tì si tiira-mɩ san waanɩ tɩ̀ tɛrɛma Yoram wote Ahabi, gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wade alɛ, <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />&lt;Walan na we gɛtɛ Ahabi e wolo Naboti ma wobi, gɛ na dɔ̀ na sɩ̀ gɛtɛ Nan yɛ wɔ̀ èè le wù gutoro gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ gaanɩ nfan.&gt; Okoro ka wɔ fun fɩna gɛtʋnkwaa gɩtɔkɔ gaanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Gɛtɛ egyu Ahasiya e we ade gɛtɛ i sere fɔ, e serenti ɛ san Bati-Hagan. Yehu ɛ ka afala e berema wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;I wolo ɛwɔ mɔ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa wotiiramisan waanɩ ɛɛ fɔrɔ Guri gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma Iblim ditele fɔ, bɛ tà gɩtà be sere wɔ, mɔ ɛ talɩ e serenti ɛ ma gyu Megido ditele, gɛ e ku dʋkɔ. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Gɛ wɔ bɛsaranyan be birima wo gikpena bɛ sa tiiramisan fɔ waanɩ bɛ san Yerusalem, gɛ be lò wɔ wote ɛbɛ bɔɔ gɩsàn gaanɩ Dafidi Ditele. <verse eid="2KI 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />Ahabi wobi Yoram gɩkyan fwo-dɩkɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, be sere Ahasiya bugyu Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesebeli di ku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehu ɛ san Yesereli. Gɛtɛ Yesebeli ɛ nʋn alɛ Yehu e gyu Yesereli fɔ, ɛ kpa-kpa wɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ pɩna wo duyu kanpɛ, gɛ è yela ɛɛ nya osele waanɩ ma nfansɩrɩ. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Gɛtɛ Yehu e gyu digyu-kpaara fɔ diitunu fɔ, Yesebeli e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ ewololɛ bɛnɩ, awɔ Simiri, à ba olila waanɩ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Yehu ɛ bʋma bʋnʋn ɛ nya wɔ nfansɩrɩ fɔ waanɩ, gɛ ɛ fa alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan nan yela mɩɩn gama? Ɛnyan?&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛsaranyan bɛnyɔɔ abɛɛ besiyee gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn digyu-kpaara fɔ bɛ nya wɔ ma nfansɩrɩ, <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />gɛ Yehu ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;I fun wɔ ɩ fɩna gɛtʋnkwaa!&gt;&gt; Gɛlɛ wuu koro be fun wɔ be ye ma nfansɩrɩ fɔ bɛ fɩna gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ wɔnkalan wʋ fɩntɩn wu lù ɔpɔrɩ ma abengyi fɔ gɛtɛ i kyɩkya wo gikpena fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="2KI 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehu e gyu digyu-kpaara fɔ daanɩ, gɛ e di gɛ ɛ nʋn. Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya ɛna gɛtɛ bɛ fwala fɔ wo koro, fɔ yàà lò wɔ yema è di gɛ egyu wobi-nanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Mɔ gɛtɛ bɛ san bàà ma lò wɔ fɔ, ben we gɩnyankɩ fɩya ma wo duyu dɩɩ dɩnankʋba, ma wɔ bɩsɩrɩ, ma walɔ. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" />Gɛtɛ be biri bɛ ma dɔ̀ Yehu fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade nyayɩ gɛ Yahwe ɛ dama wɔsaranyan Tisibe-te Eliya wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ alɛ, &lt;Gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ gɩ̀ dɔ Yesereli fɔ gii koro gɛ bɛkpɛɛ baà kɔrɔ Yesebeli gɩnan. <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />Gɛ wanankʋba yaà yasɩ Yesereli gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro gɛtɛ ɛkɩ ɛn nan we ɛ nyɩnla alɛ Yesebeli wɔ lɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yehu e wolo-wolo Ahabi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Ahabi ɛ̀ ba beteni akpilin asiyee ma fwo (70) Samariya ditele. Okoro Yehu ɛ ŋwara gɩkpa gɛ ɛ tɛ ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛndɩrɛbi, ma bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ dɔ ade yiinyun, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya Ahabi dɩkpaara dii koro fɔ. Gɩkpa fɔ gaanyungyebi yii wùlà alan, <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />&lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ yiifonte bebi bɛ̀ sa yaakʋn, gɛ tiiramisan ɛbɛ, ma abengyi, ma ditele gɛtɛ bɛ mara ɩpɔrɩ be silin di, ma akpanyan powu ɩ̀ sa yaakʋn lɛ, gɩkpa nyagɩ gɩ̀ bɔ gi gyu yaakʋn fɔ, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />i gye yiifonte bebi fɔ baanɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ kɔlɔ, gɛ ɛ kʋtʋma fɔ ɩ sɩ̀ wote gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro. Fɔ yàà kpà tɛ yiifonte dɩkpaara.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Mɔ Gɩsaa-dɩrɛ gi gyu bɛ gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Begyu bɛnyɔɔ gba bɛn talɩ yela wɔ bʋnʋn, anʋn gɛ ɛtɩ tɩ̀ talɩ tɩ mɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya digyu-kpaara fɔ dii koro, ma bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ dɔ ade yiinyun, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya egyu bebi fɔ boo koro fɔ bɛ sa Yehu ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Tì di aa bɛsaranyan, gɛ ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ aà dɔ̀ tɩ fɔ gɛ taà mɛ. Tɩ nan sere ɛkɩ bugyu. Awɔ mɛ gɩnyan kamasɛ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehu ɛ ŋwara bɛ gɩkpa nyɔɔfɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi ì yela mɩɩn gama, gɛ ì len yàà bù mɩ fɔ, gɩsa ɔkʋna nyawʋ anlɛ, i kebi Ahabi bebi baayu fɔ yàà ka mɔmɔ mɩ Yesereli.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:6">Egyu Ahabi bebi akpilin asiyee ma fwo fɔ bɛ̀ sa gɛ Samariya bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya boo koro fɔ baakʋn. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Gɩkpa fɔ gi gyu baakʋn pɛ, gɛ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ be wolo Ahabi dɩkpaara dii bebi akpilin asiyee ma fwo fɔ powu. Bɛ ka baayu fɔ bɛ sa dituya daanɩ, gɛ bɛ ka bɛ ma tɛ Yehu Yesereli. <verse eid="2KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Gɛtɛ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ bɛ sa fɔ ɛ ma gyu fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ Yehu alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛ ka Ahabi bebi baayu fɔ bɛ ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:8">Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehu ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ma kʋla yɩ akpen anyɔɔ ditele fɔ diitunu, ɩ yɛ yàà dʋrɔ dʋkɔ kpa kere.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />Kere gɩkpa fɔ, Yehu e ye e yela bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɔɔ bʋnʋn okòro gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩn nyɩ ade ɩkɩ yaanɩ. Nmɩ na ka amɩnlɛ-kpe miinfonte wo koro gɛ na wolo wɔ, mɔ ɛnyan na wolo nyabɛ powu lɛ? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Ade nyayɩ yii wùlà alɛ digyebi dɩkɩ dɩ̀ ma gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alɛ daà ba Ahabi dɩkpaara dii koro gɛ dɩn ba waanɩ. Yahwe ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɛ dama wɔsaranyan Eliya wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Okoro Yehu e wolo ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ e kuruma Ahabi dɩkpaara daanɩ Yesereli ditele daanɩ fɔ, gɛlɛ ke gɛ e wolo Ahabi wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi, ma wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gbɛma wɔ, ma wo gedi gɩɩ bɛtàlɛ powu gɛ ɛkɩ en kuruma. <verse eid="2KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Gɛ Yehu ɛ tɔ ɛ da Samariya gɩlan. Gɛtɛ ɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ, ɛ ma dʋrɔ Beti-Ekedi bɛnan bɔɔ bɛnyalɛ bɔɔ gɛyakʋn. <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" />E tuma Yuda wogyu Ahasiya bɛfʋrɩ bɛkɩ dʋkɔ gɛ e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ì di gaanɩ?&gt;&gt; Be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Tì di egyu Ahasiya bɛfʋrɩ, gɛ tɩɩ fɔrɔ tɩ ma sa egyu Ahabi bɛfʋrɩ ma egyu-nanɩ fɔ onyun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Gɛ Yehu ɛ fa wɔ bɛsaranyan alan, &lt;&lt;I gye bɛ gʋnʋn-ŋɔrɔ!&gt;&gt; Okoro be gye bɛnɩ akpilin-anyɔɔ ma bɛnyɔɔ fɔ powu, gɛ be belen bɛ ayu ditiribun gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Beti-Ekedi fɔ dɩɩ pɩ. En kere baanɩ ɛkɩ ya. <verse eid="2KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Gɛtɛ Yehu e ye dʋkɔ fɔ, e tuma Rekabi wobi Yehonadabi. Yehu ɛ sa wɔ onyun gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;À ba dɩmɩnlɛ-kɩlɩn ma nmɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ n ba tɛ wɔ fɔ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yehonadabi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yehu ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi wʋ̀ dɔ gɛlɛ fɔ ka aa gʋlɔ ba.&gt;&gt;Okoro Yehonadabi ɛ tʋna gʋlɔ ɛ tɛ wɔ, gɛ Yehu e ton wɔ e gyu tiiramisan fɔ waanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />Gɛ Yehu ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ba taà san fɔ àà ma nya anlɛ gɛtɛ na ka miin koro na tɛ Yahwe.&gt;&gt; Okoro Yehonadabi ma ɛwɔ ba sara wotiiramisan fɔ waanɩ bɛ da. <verse eid="2KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Gɛtɛ Yehu e gyu Samariya fɔ, e wolo Ahabi wɔ fʋrɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ e kuruma ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔbɛ fɔ. E muru bɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ Eliya fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehu e wolo Baali bekpente</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Gɛ Yehu e kpèlè bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa ditele fɔ daanɩ e tuma, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ahabi ɛ sʋma Baali bɛrɛɛ lɛ, mɔ nmɩ nan sʋma wɔ gepepe. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />I kpèlè Baali bɛtabʋrʋlɛ, ma wo bekpente, ma wɔ bɛsʋmalɛ powu ɩ ba. Ɩ nya ɛkamasɛ ɛɛ̀ ba, yema ǹ bɛ tɛ Baali gedi-dɩrɛ gɩkɩ. Ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ sʋna Baali, gɛ ɛn ba fɔ, baà wolo wɔ.&gt;&gt; Yehu dɩmɩnlɛ n di gɛtɛ eè muru Baali bɛsʋmalɛ powu. <verse eid="2KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Gɛ Yehu ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ alɛ, ɩ yɛ taà nya duwi dɩkɩ tɩ sɩ̀ fɔ tàà tuma tɩ sʋma ti tiri Baali diyere.&gt;&gt;Okoro bɛ mɛ gɛlɛ. <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehu ɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ san Isareli, bɛ ma dɔ̀ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ sʋma Baali fɔ powu gɛ bɛ ba gɛtɛ ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn gba en terema. Be gyu bɛ yɔn Baali dikwo daanɩ ofèn ma ofèn. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Gɛ Yehu ɛ dɔ̀ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya ngba yɩɩ dɩdaka dii koro fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɛ ɛkamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ sʋma Baali fɔ gɛgba fɔ gɩkɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sa.&gt;&gt; Okoro ɛ ka ngba fɔ ɛ bɛ tɛ bɛ.<verse eid="2KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehu ma Rekabi wobi Yehonadabi bɛ da be gyu Baali dikwo fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ Yehu ɛ dɔ̀ Baali bɛsʋmalɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya gepe gɛtɛ Yahwe wɔsʋmalɛ ɛkɩ ɛn fɩya yaanɩ, wù di gɛ Baali bɛsʋmalɛ booko booko boo ge tuma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Gɛ Yehu ma Yehonadabi be gyu gɛtɛ bàà tɛ Baali gedi ma gekuma gii gedi. Fɔ Yehu ɛ yɛ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin anaa be silin dikwo fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi yaanɩ ɛkɩ ɛ yɛ bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ e serenti fɔ, ɛɛ̀ ka wɔnkpa e le gutoro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Gɛtɛ Yehu ɛ bɔ ɛ tɛ gedi fɔ e were fɔ, ɛ fa ɛ sa wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Oke, I gyu i wolo bɛ. Ɩ kara yɛ baanɩ ɛkɩ èè ye.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɛ ka bɔɔ bɛ bɛtata be wolo bɛ powu. Gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ be tiira boo gikpena bɛ bɛ sɩ̀ okòro. Gɛ Yehu bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ be gyu Baali dikwo fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />Be tiri Baali dikpenta fɔ be ye okòro gɛ be kuma dɩ. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Be gbena Baali wakpenta gɛ bɛ mɩna wo dikwo fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka dʋkɔ be bilingi ɔkpan be ye ma ǹdò. <verse eid="2KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Anlɛ gɛ Yehu ɛ ka ɛ mɩna Baali dɩsʋma Isareli. <verse eid="2KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />Mɔ, Yehu en kere ade-kpen gɛtɛ Nebati wobi Yerobowam ɛ mɛ, gɛ ɛ yɛ Isareli bete mɔ bɛ mɛ fɔ yɩɩ gɛ mɛ ya. Ɛ yɛ bɛ sʋma sɩka-sɩya akwɔbi gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ ɛ sɩ̀ Beteli ma Dan fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Yehu alan, &lt;&lt;A mɛ ade gɛtɛ ii dì mɩ gʋnʋn yema a muru Ahabi ma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ. Gɛlɛ wuu koro nan yɛ aadu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ baà dì bugyu Isareli ka ma sere gewo-tama-naafɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Mɔ Yehu ɛn ka woturu powu ton Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ wo-ise fɔ. En kere ade-kpen gɛtɛ Yerobowam ɛ mɛ, gɛ ɛ yɛ Isareli bete mɔ bɛ mɛ fɔ ya. <verse eid="2KI 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Awi ɩtɔkɔ yaanɩ, Yahwe e sere ɔpɩ ɛɛ tɩyɛra Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa pɩɩ pɩɩ. Egyu Haseli e to Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ kpekpesi. <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />Yodan wofila wʋʋ gɛtakʋn wʋʋ gɩlan, fɩya ma Gileyadi powu, ma Gadi, ma Ruben, ma Manase. Bɛ ka gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ be ye Arore ditele ma ye Arinon dɩtagba daanɩ ka ma sere Gileyadi ma Basan <verse eid="2KI 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yehu ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma ade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Yehu e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ Samariya. Gɛ wobi Yehohasi e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Yehu ɛ sara Samariya e di Isareli bugyu bɩkyan dikpilin ma nɩyɛ.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Ataliya ma Yowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ egyu-nanɩ Ataliya ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ wobi-teni Ahasiya e ku fɔ, ɛ san alɛ ɛ̀ ma wolo digyu-kpaara fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Mɔ egyu-dɩrɛ Yehoram wobi-nanɩ Yehoseba gɛtɛ e di Ahasiya wonosobi fɔ, ɛ ka Ahasiya wobi Yowasi e serenti e ye digyu-kpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ baà be wolo fɔ baanɩ. Ɛ ka ebi fɔ ma ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya ebi fɔ wo koro fɔ ɛ ma bubwa Dikwo-dɩrɛ dii dikwo-dʋrɔlɛ dɩkɩ daanɩ. Okoro Ataliya en wura wolo wɔ. <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Yowasi ma wɔnyalɛ fɔ be bu Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ bɩkyan kooron, fɔ Ataliya ee di bugyu gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />Mɔ gɩkyan kwarankɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyada ɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ma ka bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ dikpilin ma bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya digyu-kpaara fɔ dii koro ma digyu-kpaara bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ bɛ ba Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dʋkɔ. Gɛ ɛ ta dikola ma ɛbɛ, gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ kan ntam Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ e wùlà bɛ egyu wobi Yowasi. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi ɩ̀ ba gʋtʋn duwi-tʋnalɛ daanɩ fɔ, i yo yaanɩ akpen asiyee fɔ dikpen dɩkɩ dàà dɩyɛ digyu-kpaara fɔ, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />dikpen dɩkɩ mɔ dàà dɩyɛ Sur wotunu, fɔ dikpen siyeefɛ fɔ mɔ dàà dɩyɛ otunu gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa digyu-kpaara dɩ̀ gama fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />Fɔ akpen anyɔɔ gɛtɛ ɩɩn san gʋtʋn duwi tunalɛ daanɩ fɔ yàà ma yela Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩpɩ dɩyɛ egyu fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />Yaà mɛ egyu bɛdɩyɛlɛ gɛ yaà ton yaakpanyan. Ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ san fɔ, ɩ gbɛma wɔ, gɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ gbɛma yɩ fɔ, i wolo wɔ. <verse eid="2KI 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yehoyada ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ fɔ. Ɛkamasɛ ɛ ka wɔ bɛnɩ, ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ san gʋtʋn duwi tunalɛ daanɩ, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛn taa san gʋtʋn duwi tunalɛ daanɩ powu gɛ bɛ ba gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyada wakʋn. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Gɛ ɛ tɛ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɩtʋrʋnyan ma awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro gɛtɛ nafɔ ì di Dafidi woyo, gɛ bɛ ka yɩ bɛ sɩ̀ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />Gɛ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ be yela be silin egyu fɔ gɛtɛ bè de baakpanyan. Be yela ye gbɛma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ye gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan ma sere gatala gɩɩ gɩlan. <verse eid="2KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehoyada e ye ma egyu wobi Yowasi okòro, gɛ e tin wɔ digyu-koto, gɛ ɛ ka dikola gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ tà ma ɛbɛ fɔ dɩɩ gɩkpa ɛ tɛ wɔ, gɛ e sere wɔ bugyu. Bɛ sʋrʋ wɔ bʋnɔ, gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ ka afala ma alɔ yɩɩ gɛ gbɛrɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu sara nkpa ma ɔfɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Gɛtɛ egyu-nanɩ Ataliya ɛ nʋn afala gɛtɛ bɛdɩyɛlɛ ma bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ gbɛrɛ fɔ, ɛ san bɛnɩ fɔ baakʋn Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ dʋkɔ. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" />Gɛtɛ ɛ nya lɛ fɔ, egyu fɔ n yela ma pila anlɛ gɛtɛ boodu wade mɛlɛ ii wùlà fɔ. Bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ ma akantan yɩɩ bɛfʋ̀nlɛ be yela egyu fɔ wakʋn, gɛ gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu bee di ɔsɛ gɛ bɛɛ fʋ̀n akantan. Gɛ Ataliya ɛ fɛɛran wɔ gɛgba gɛ gbɛrɛ afala kin-kin alan,&lt;&lt;Ɛgbanlɛ bɛnɩ! Ɛgbanlɛ bɛnɩ! <verse eid="2KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyada ɛ dɔ̀ bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya akpen fɔ yii koro fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;I tiri wɔ i ye Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ afan, fɔ yàà wolo ɛkamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ tɛrɛma wɔ fɔ. Ɩ kara wolo wɔ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ nfan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro be gye wɔ, gɛ bɛ ka wɔ be ye ma otunu gɛtɛ abengyi yii ka i gyu digyu kpaara fɔ, gɛ be wolo wɔ dʋkɔbɛ. <verse eid="2KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />Yehoyada ɛ tà dikola ɛ tɛ Yahwe, ma egyu fɔ, ma bɛnɩ fɔ alɛ baà mɛ Yahwe bɛnɩ. Gɛ e biri ɛ tà dikola ɛ tɛ egyu ma bɛnɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ san Baali dikpen-kwo bɛ ma sila dɩ bɛ fɩna. Be gbena gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn ma bekpen fɔ buruburu gɛ be wolo Baali wokpente Matan gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn dʋkɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 11:18">Gɛ Yehoyada ɛ sɩ̀ bɛdɩyɛlɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Gɛ ɛ ka bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ dikpilin, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ dɩyɛ egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara diitunu, ma gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu bɛ tɛrɛma egyu fɔ be ye Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ bɛ san digyu-kpaara, gɛ ɛ ma sara gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Gɛ gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu be di ɔsɛ, gɛ ditele fɔ daanɩ dɩ mɛ yiridi yema be wolo Ataliya digyu-kpaara dʋkɔ. <verse eid="2KI 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Yowasi e di bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan kwarankɩ.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />Yehu gɩkyan-kwarankɩfɛ gaanɩ gɛtɛ ee di bugyu Isareli fɔ, gɛ bɛ sɩ̀ Yowasi bugyu Yuda, gɛ e di bugyu fɔ Yerusalem ditele bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ. Wɔna diyere n di Sibiya gɛtɛ e ye Beseba fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Yowasi ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn bɩkyan powu gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyida ee wùlà wɔ ade fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Mɔ bɛn mɩna bekpen baasʋmakʋn fɔ, okoro bɛnɩ bɛ̀ sangba bɛɛ tɛ gedi gɛ bee kuma olifwi dʋkɔ.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yowasi ɛ dɔ̀ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kʋla sɩka gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka bɛ bɛ tɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ, gɛtɛ wù di bɛnɩ bɔɔ gɛkalan gɩɩ sɩka, ma sɩka bɛnɩ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ sɩ̀ alɛ baà le fɔ, ma sɩka gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛɛ tɛ be ye boo-ituru yaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />Wù di gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ-kamasɛ èè to sɩka fɔ e ye sɩka bɛsɩ̀lɛ baakʋn, fɔ bàà ka sɩka fɔ pɩna ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ wʋ mɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Mɔ egyu-dɩrɛ Yowasi bugyu buu gedi bɩkyan dikpilin ma bisiyee powu baanɩ fɔ, gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bɛn tɛ pɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ Yowasi e kpèlè gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Yehoyada ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ-do fɔ e tuma, gɛ e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩɩn taa pɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ-ɩkʋn-mɩnalɛkʋn fɔ? Ɩ kara ni to kɔba i ye bɛsɩ̀lɛ fɔ baakʋn, mɔ ɩ ka wʋ ɩ tɛ, fɔ bàà ka wʋ pɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ be yera gɛtɛ bɛn nan ni to sɩka be ye bɛnɩ baakʋn, gɛ ɛbɛ gbagba bɛn mɩnɩ pɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyada ɛ ka dɩdaka, gɛ e duru dii ditinbi fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka dɩ ɛ sɩ̀ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gɩɩpɩ, Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ diilogyi-lɔ, gengyi ɛkɩ ee gyu daanɩ fɔ. Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ sara otunu fɔ bɛ ka sɩka powu gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛɛ ka bɛ ba Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ bɛ sa dɩdaka fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ bè we gɛtɛ sɩka sɩka gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛ ka bɛ ba Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ wʋ sɔ fɔ, egyu gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ bɛɛ bɛ̀ kalan wʋ, fɔ bɛ ka wʋ bɛ sa bekotoku baanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Gengyi bɛ̀ kalan sɩka fɔ be were fɔ, bɛɛ ka wʋ bɛ tɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gii koro fɔ. Bɛɛ ka sɩka fɔ be le iyon yɩɩ bɛsalɩlɛ ma bɛmaralɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />ma ɩpɔrɩ yii beserelɛ, ma ataa yɩɩ bɛkpalɩlɛ. Be se iyon-serelɛ ma ataa kpalɩlɛ tɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gɛpɩna ma anyan gɛtɛ ii hiyan fɔ powu.<verse eid="2KI 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Bɛn ka sɩka gɛtɛ bɛ ka bɛ ba Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ mɛ sɩka-fututu bɛtasa, abɛɛ omini-tiiralɛ kandɩya wayenkpen, abɛɛ bɛtasa-ŋwanlɛ anyan, abɛɛ akantan, abɛɛ sɩka-sɩya abɛɛ sɩka-fututu gɩnyankɩ tɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />Mɔ fɔ, bɛ ka gɛ sɩka fɔ bɛ tɛ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ bàà ka pɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" />Gɛ bɛn yɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ ka sɩka fɔ bɛ tɛ alɛ be le gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ bàà mɛ akʋnta, yema bɛ ka nʋnkwarɩ bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ powu. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" />Mɔ sɩka gɛtɛ bɛnɩ be le tɛ dɩpwɛ dii gedi, ma dɩdɩɩ dɩ gɛkpa dɩɩ sɩka fɔ bɩrɛ, bɛn ka wʋ ba Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ. Ɛwʋ wù di gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ booyo. <verse eid="2KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ Hasayeli ɛ san ɛ ma kpà ma Gati ditele, gɛ e gye dɩ bɩtà. Wʋʋ gama fɔ, ɛ mɛ wamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ eè fi ɛ san ɛ ma tà bɩtà ma Yerusalem ditele. <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />Mɔ Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yowasi ɛ ka anyan gɛtɛ wotu ɛbɛ Yehosafati, ma Yehoram, ma Ahasiya gɛtɛ be di bugyu Yuda bɛ nya, gɛ be tiri bɛ sɩ̀ bɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ, ma anyan gɛtɛ ɛwɔ gbagba e tiri ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ Yahwe, fɩya ma sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bɛɛ sɩ̀ anyan gbaa-gbaa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, ma digyukpaara fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka yɩ powu ɛ ma tɛ Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ Hasayeli. Gɛlɛ wuu koro, egyu Hasayeli ɛn mɩnɩ tà bɩtà fɔ ma Yerusalem.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yowasi ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ fɔ bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade waakpa yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Yowasi bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ mɛ onyun wo koro, gɛ be wolo wɔ Milo dɩkpaara daanɩ, osele gɛtɛ wʋ waran wʋʋ fɔrɔ Sila wɔlanlan waanɩ fɔ waanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ be wolo wɔ fɔ n di, Simeti wobi Yosabadi, ma Someri wobi Yehosabadi. E ku, gɛ be lò wɔ Dafidi Ditele, wotu ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɩsan baanɩ. Gɛ wobi Amasiya e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yehwahasi e di bugyu Isareli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />Ahasiya wobi Yowasi gɛtɛ è di Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ gɩkyan dikpilin ma siyeefɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Yehu wobi Yehwahasi e be di bugyu Isareli, gɛ ɛ sara Samariya. Gɛ e di bugyu bɩkyan fwo kwarankɩ. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn. Ɛ tɛrɛma Nebati wobi egyu-dɩrɛ Yerobwam wo-isele, gɛ wʋ yɛ Isareli bete be gyu ade-kpen yaanɩ fɔ, gɛ en kere ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛmɛ ya. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />Okoro Yahwe ɛ ka owurufa Isareli bete boo koro, gɛ ɛ ka bɛ ɛ sa Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ Hasayeli ma wobi Ben-Hadadi baalɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehwahasi e wula e kpèlè Yahwe, gɛ Yahwe ɛ nʋn wo gewula-kpèlè fɔ, yema e we anlɛ gɛtɛ Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛɛ nyanla Isareli bete fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" />Okoro Yahwe e tiri etolɛ-yalɛ ɛkɩ ɛ tɛ Isareli bete, gɛ wʋ yɛ be ye Aram bete baalɔ yaanɩ. Gɛlɛ wuu koro Isareli bete be biri bɛ ma sara bɔɔ-ɩlɛ olila waanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ fʋrʋma bɛ sara fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Mɔ ben kere ade-kpen gɛtɛ Yerobwam dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛɛ mɛ, gɛ wʋ yɛ Isareli bete mɔ be gyu ade-kpen yaanɩ fɔ ya. Bɛ̀ bɔ bɛɛ mɛ gɛ ade-kpe fɔ. Gɛ ekpen Asera woyon fɔ mɔ wʋ̀ bɔ wù yela Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Yehohasi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ be kuruma fɔ n di abengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo, ma tiiramisan ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛsaralɛ fwo, ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro ɩgbaa ton (10,000). Yema Aram wogyu e wolo bekurumakyɛɛ. E kyikya bɛ ma bɩsɩrɩ ɛ mɛ anlɛ itinbu.<verse eid="2KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yehwahasi ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma wakpa gɛtɛ ɛ kpà powu fɔ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Yehwahasi e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ Samariya ditele. Gɛ wobi Yehowasi e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehwasi e di bugyu Isareli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yowasi gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-kwarankɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Yehwahasi wobi Yehwasi e sere bugyu buu gedi Isareli. E di bugyu Samariya bɩkyan fwo kooron. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe Bʋnʋn, gɛ en kere ade-kpen gɛtɛ Nebati wobi Yerobwam ɛ mɛ gɛ wʋ yɛ Isareli bete mɔ be gyu ade-kpen yaanɩ fɔ ya.<verse eid="2KI 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yehwasi ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ, ma wakpa gɛtɛ ɛ kpà ma Amasiya fɔ powu yaade bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Yehwasi e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ begyu-dɩrɛ boo gelòkʋn Samariya ditele daanɩ. Gɛ Yerobwam e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />Pɛ Yehwasi èè be ku fɔ, Elisa e yeba geyeba gɩkɩ gɛtɛ gi wolo wɔ fɔ. Wo geyeba fɔ gaanɩ fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ Yehwasi ɛ san wakʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma sa wɔ onyun. Gɛtɛ e gyu wakʋn fɔ, e wula ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinte! Miinte! Awɔ n di Isareli wo betitiiramisan bɛsaralɛ ma wakpɔŋɔ yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ fɔ bɔɔkɛma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Gɛ Elisa alan, &lt;&lt;Len Gyangarɩ ma gɩsɩnta ba!&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ mɛ gɛlɛ. <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka gyangarɩ fɔ ton.&gt;&gt; Gɛtɛ ɛ ka gyangarɩ fɔ e ton fɔ, Elisa ɛ ka walɔ ɛ sa egyu-dɩrɛ walɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tana nfansɩrɩ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa ofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan fɔ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ tana wʋ. Gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tà gɩtà fɔ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ tà gɩ. Gɩsɩnta nyagɩ gì yela tɛ gedi gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ yɛ wɔ̀ àà di Aram bete boo koro. Aà muru Aram bete powu Afeki ditele daanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka bɩsɩnta fɔ!&gt; Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ ka bʋ e ton. Gɛ Elisa ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tà sere gɛtʋnkwaa!&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ tà e sere gɛtʋnkwaa disere disiyee gɛ e kere ɛ ya. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa ɛ ka owurufa, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wù di gɛtɛ nafɔ àà tà gɩtà fɔ sere gɛtʋnkwaa disere ton abɛɛ disere kooron. Gɛlɛ fɔ, nafɔ aà di Aram wo koro, fɔ àà muru wɔ kɩrɩkɩrɩ. Mɔ aà yɛ a di gɛ wo koro disere disiyee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Elisa e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 13:20">Waanɩ fɔ, Mowabi beyukurulɛ bɛɛ tɩ̀ ma gyu Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ okene-fila waanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Duwi dɩkɩ, gɛtɛ Isareli bete bɛ san bàà ma lò ete ɛkɩ fɔ, disere-kɩlɩn fɔ, be we beyukurulɛ boo dikpi dɩkɩ. Okoro be fun ete fɔ gikpena fɔ bɛ sa Elisa gɩsàn gaanɩ. Gɛtɛ ete fɔ gikpena fɔ gɩ kya Elisa wanankʋba fɔ, ete fɔ ɛ lama ɛ ba nkpa anɩ, gɛ ɛ tɔ e yela wɔ bɩsɩrɩ buu koro.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli ma Aram baakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ Hasayeli ɛ nyanla Isareli bete Yehwahasi bugyu buu gedi bʋʋya powu waanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />Mɔ Yahwe e len baade, gɛ e we boo gutunkoro, gɛ ɛ̀ fɛ ma baade, yema dikola gɛtɛ ɛ tà ma Abraham, ma Isaki, ma Yakobu fɔ dii koro. Bè ye ma ǹdò, en len gɛtɛ èè muru bɛ, gɛ en len gɛtɛ èè tiri bʋnʋn yɛ bɛ.<verse eid="2KI 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ Hasayeli e ku, gɛ wobi Ben-Hadadi e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehwahasi wobi Yehwasi e biri ɛ kpà e to atele gɛtɛ Hasayeli wobi Ben-Hadadi e tì to e ye wote Yehwahasi wakʋn akpa yaanɩ fɔ. Yehwasi e di wo koro disere disiyee, okoro e to Isareli watele fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Amasiya e di bugyu Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />Yehwahasi wobi Yehwasi gɛtɛ è di Isareli bete boogyu-dɩrɛ fɔ bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Yowasi wobi Amasiya e di bugyu Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Amasiya e di bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton. Gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan dikpilin ma yɛkɩ. Wɔna diyere n di Yehwadin, gɛ e ye Yerusalem. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ii di Yahwe gʋnʋn, mɔ wʋn nɩma anlɛ gɛtɛ wotu Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ. Ɛ tɛrɛma gɛ wote Yowasi, ade-mɛlɛ powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Mɔ en gbena asʋmakʋn fɔ, gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ̀ sangba bɛɛ tɛ gedi, gɛ bee kuma ilifwi dʋkɔ. <verse eid="2KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Gɛtɛ Amasiya bugyu buu gedi fɔ bu sere ɩkpaa fɔ, e wolo bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ be wolo wote egyu fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" />Mɔ en wolo bɛnɩ gɛtɛ e wolo fɔ boo bebi, anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara Mose Ise yɩɩ Gɩkpa gaanɩ alɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kara wolo bɛtaawe bebi baade-kpen yii koro, gɛ ɩ kara wolo bebi bɛtaawe baade-kpen yii koro, ɛkamasɛ wade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ yii diku gɛ eè ku&gt;&gt; fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />Amasiya e wolo Edom bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin ton Bʋbɔlɛ bʋʋ Dɩtagba daanɩ gɛ e to Sela ditele gɛ ɛ sa dɩ diyere alɛ Yokiteli, gɛ gɛlɛ gɛ bee kpèlè dɩ bè ye ma ǹdò.<verse eid="2KI 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Amasiya ɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ma dɔ̀ Yehu wɔnana Yehwasi gɛtɛ è di Yehwahasi wobi fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Bè tuma mɩ, fɔ tàà kpà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Mɔ Isareli wogyu Yehowasi e birima ɔtʋn ɛ tɩyɛma Yuda wogyu Amasiya alan, &lt;&lt;Dɩfa ma iwiya gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Lebanon wo-idon yaanɩ fɔ, dɩ sa seda wo-iyon ɔtʋn alɛ, &lt;Ka aabi-nanɩ tɛ miinbi-tenɩi èè to gɩna.&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ dɩfa dɩɩnan ɛkɩ e be kyɩkya dɩfa ma iwiya fɔ ɛ mɩna. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />Wʋ̀ sa waanɩ alɛ a di Edom bete boo koro, gɛ wʋ yɛ wɔ̀ aa bʋma koro gatala. Yɛ wàà di wɔ̀ gʋnʋn alɛ a di boo koro, mɔ waran sara aalɛ! Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa len ade gɛtɛ yaà ka gyerebi ɩ mɔma awɔ ma Yuda bɛnɩ powu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Mɔ Amasiya e terema, ɛn nʋn. Okoro Isareli wogyu Yehwasi ɛ ka wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛ bɛ ma kpà ma egyu Yuda wogyu Amasiya, Beti-Semesi ditele gɛtɛ dɩ sa Yuda fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be di Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ boo koro, gɛ wʋ yɛ Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be serenti bɛ da baatele yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Isareli wogyu Yehowasi e gye Yuda wogyu Amasiya gɛtɛ è di Yowasi wobi, gɛ è di Ahasiya wɔnana fɔ bɩtà Beti-Semesi. Gɛ Yehowasi ɛ san Yerusalem ɛ ma sila Yerusalem wɔpɔrɩ fɔ ɛ fɩna, ye Efrayim wotunu ka ma sere otunu gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Kɔna Wotunu fɔ. Ɔpɔrɩ gɛtɛ e sila fɔ waà mɛ bɩsɩrɩ nkpɩn bisiyee (600). <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Gɛ ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ma sɩka-fututu powu, ma anyɩmɩnyan gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ, ma digyu-kpaara daanyan-kpara fɔ powu. E gye bɛnɩ fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka bɛ ɛ da Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yehwasi ɛ mɛ, ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma wakpa gɛtɛ ɛ kpà ma Yuda wogyu Amasiya powu fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Yehwasi e ku gɛ be lò wɔ Samariya Isareli begyu boo gelòkʋn. Gɛ wobi Yerobwam e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Yowasi wobi Amasiya gɛtɛ è di Yuda wogyu fɔ ɛ sara bɩkyan fwo ton Yehwahasi wobi Yehwasi gɛtɛ è di Isareli wogyu fɔ diku dɩɩ gama. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Amasiya ɛ mɛ, ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Yerusalem bɛnɩ bɛkɩ bɛ mɛ onyun bàà wolo Amasiya Yerusalem, gɛ e serenti ɛ san Lakisi. Mɔ bɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ tɛrɛma wɔ bɛ san dʋkɔ bɛ ma wolo wɔ. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Gɛ bɛ ka wo gikpena fɔ bɛ gyaga dibengyi dii koro bɛ ba Yerusalem, gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ boo gelòkʋn, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yuda bɛnɩ powu be gye Asariya bɛ sɩ̀ bugyu be sere wote Amasiya bɩsɩrɩ. Waanɩ fɔ Asariya e di bɩkyan fwo-kooron. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />Wote diku dɩɩ gama fɔ, Asariya na biri e sere Elati ditele ɛ tɛ Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Yerobwam-nyɔɔfɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />Yowasi wobi Amasiya bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-tonfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Isareli wogyu Yehwasi wobi Yerobwam e sere Isereli bugyu buu gedi Samariya ditele, gɛ e di bugyu fɔ bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma gɩkɩ. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn baanɩ, gɛ en tiri koro ye ade-kpen gɛtɛ Nebati wobi Yerobwam ɛ yɛ Isareli bete be gyu yaanɩ fɔ ya. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" />Yerobwam-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ na to-to Isareli ntʋnkwaa gɛtɛ ɩ̀ dɔ ye Lebo-Hamati ma sere Bʋbɔlɛ Bʋʋpʋ wʋʋpɩ, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ ɛ da ma Amitayi wobi Yona, gɛtɛ è di Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ e ye Gati-Hefa fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />Yahwe e we anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ sa Isareli fɔ ɛ̀ sa dɩfana-dɩrɛ daanɩ. Wù di ɛdɩ̀ oo, ɛnɩ gɛtɛ e to koro oo, ɛkamasɛ ɛ̀ sa dɩfana daanɩ. Gɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn ma gɛtɛ ɛɛ kpà bɛ. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />Gɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛn dɔ alɛ ɛɛ̀ kpa Isareli diyere e ye gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ gakpaakpa okoro, ɛ da ma Yehwasi wobi Yerobwam wo koro e to bɛ ɛ ya.<verse eid="2KI 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yerobwam-nyɔɔfɛ ɛ mɛ, ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma wakpa gɛtɛ ɛ kpà e to ntʋnkwaa ɛ tɛ Isareli gɛtɛ Damasiko ma Hamati ɩ fɩya powu fɔ, gɛtɛ nafɔ ì di gɛ Yewodi woyo fɔ, bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Yerobwam-nyɔɔfɛ e ku gɛ be lò wɔ Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo gelòkʋn. Gɛ wobi Sekariya e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Asariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />Isareli wogyu Yerobwam-nyɔɔfɛ wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan dikpilin ma kwarankɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Amasiya wobi-teni Asariya e sere bugyu buu gedi Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ e di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan fwo-kooron. E di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bʋnyɔɔ. Wɔna diyere n di Yekoliya, gɛ e ye Yerusalem. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ii di Yahwe gʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ wote Amasiya ɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />Mɔ en gbena asʋmakʋn fɔ, okoro bɛnɩ bɛ̀ sangba bɛɛ tɛ gedi gɛ bee kuma olifwi dʋkɔbɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />Yahwe ɛ sa egyu fɔ geyeba-sɩya ka ma sere duwi gɛtɛ e ku. Ɛ sara dɩkpaara kperen dɩkɩ daanɩ woko-kwan, gɛ wobi Yotam na yɛ ɛ nya digyukpaara fɔ ma gɩfɩɩ fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ boo koro.<verse eid="2KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Asariya ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ, ma wade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ powu fɔ, bɛ sa Yuda begyu boo koro gaade wʋʋ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Asariya e ku gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɩsàn baanɩ, gbɛma ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele fɔ. Gɛ wobi Yotam e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Sekariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />Yuda wogyu Asariya wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Yerobwam wobi-teni Sekariya e be di bugyu Isareli. Ɛ sara Samariya, gɛ e di bugyu fɔ bebon kooron. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ wotu ɛbɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ. En foma ye Nebati wobi Yerobwam wade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ gɛ wʋ yɛ Isareli bete be gyu ade-kpen yaanɩ fɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Yabesi wobi Salum ɛ ka amɩnlɛ-kpen Sekariya wo koro. Ɛ tɔ ɛ tàmà wɔ bɛnɩ baanɩ gɛ e wolo wɔ, gɛ e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="2KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Sekariya ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ fɔ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" />Okoro Yahwe wade gɛtɛ ɛ dama Yahu wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Aadu waanɩ wuu bebi baà sara Isareli gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro ka ma ye gewo tama gii bebi-naafɛ&gt;&gt; fɔ ɩ ba waanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Salum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Yuda wogyu Usiya bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo yɛkɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Yabesi wobi Salum e be di bugyu. Gɛ e di bugyu Samariya ebon. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Salum bugyu buu gedi ebon gama fɔ, Gadi wobi Menahem ɛ tɔ e ye Tirisa ɛ san Samariya, ɛ ma wolo Yabesi wobi Salum Samariya ditele daanɩ, gɛ e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Salum ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ tɔ e yela Sekariya wo koro gɛ e wolo wɔ fɔ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Menahem e ye Tirisa gɛ ɛ ma kpà ma Tifisa gɛ e wolo ditele fɔ ma dii-ikere-ikere yɩɩ bɛnɩ powu yema be terema bɛn ka koro tɛ. E berema Tifisa gɛ ɛ tɛrɛ-tɛrɛ beborona powu baaboro.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Menahem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />Yuda wogyu Asariya wɔ gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo yɛkɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Gadi wobi Menahem e be di bugyu Isareli, gɛ e di bugyu ɛ sara Samariya ditele daanɩ bɩkyan fwo. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn. Wo bugyu buu gedi bʋʋya waanɩ powu fɔ, en foma ye Nebati wobi Yerobwam wade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ gɛ wʋ yɛ Isareli bete be gyu ade-kpen yaanɩ fɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Asiriya wogyu Puli ɛ ba ee to Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ Menahem ɛ tɛ wɔ sɩka-fututu bekotoku nkpɩn ton fɔ Asiriya wogyu èè wura kpa wɔ̀ fɔ èè wura wura ɔkɛma gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Menahem ɛ nyɩ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba kɔba fɔ alɛ ɛkamasɛ e le sɩka-fututu kilo-fan, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka tɛ Asiriya wogyu. Okoro Asiriya wogyu e kpe e ye gɛtɛ ɛn mɩnɩ sara gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Menahem ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ ma ade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Menahem e ku gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ boo gelòkʋn. Gɛ wobi Pekahiya e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Pekahiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />Yuda wogyu Asariya wɔ gɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwofɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Pekahiya wobi Menahem e be di bugyu Isareli. E di bugyu ɛ sara Samariya bɩkyan bʋnyɔɔ. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />Pekahiya ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn. En foma ye Nebati wobi Yeroboham wade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ gɛ ɛ yɛ Isareli bete mɔ be gyu ade-kpen yaanɩ fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Remaliya wobi Peka gɛtɛ è di wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ fɔ ɛ tɔ e yela wo koro. Ɛ ka Gileyadi bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo ɛ fɩya ma koro gɛ e wolo Pekihiya, ma Arigobi, ma Ariye Samariya digyu-kpara daanɩ. Okoro Peka e wolo Pekahiya gɛ e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Pekahiya ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ ma ade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Peka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />Yuda wogyu Asariya bugyu buu gedi wuu gɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwofɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Remaliya wobi Peka e sere bugyu buu gedi Isareli, gɛ ɛ sara Samariya e di bugyu fɔ bɩkyan dikpilin. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn. En foma ye Nebati wobi Yerobwam wade-kpen gɛtɛ wʋ yɛ Isareli bete mɔ be gyu yaanɩ fɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Peka wɔya waanɩ fɔ, Asiriya wogyu Tigalati-Pilesa e be gye Iyon, ma Abeli-Beti-Maaka, ma Yanowa, ma Kadesi, ma Haso. E gye Gileyadi ma Galile, ma Nafitali wɔ ntʋnkwaa powu gɛ ɛ ka bɛnɩ fɔ e da Asiriya. <verse eid="2KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Husiya wobi Yotam gɛtɛ è di Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ fɔ gɩkyan dikpilinfɛ gaanɩ gɛ Ela wobi Hoseya ɛ tɔ e yela Remaliya wobi Peka wo koro, gɛ e wolo wɔ. Ɛwʋ di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Peka ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ ma ade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yotam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />Remaliya wobi Peka gɛtɛ è di Isareli wogyu fɔ wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Husiya wobi Yotam e sere bugyu buu gedi Yuda gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />E di bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton pɛ gɛ e di bugyu. Gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan fwo kooron. Wɔna diyere n di Yerusa gɛtɛ è di Sadoki wobi-nanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn baanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ wote Usiya ɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Mɔ asʋmakʋn fɔ bɩrɛ, ben tiri gɛ bɛnɩ bɛ bɔ bɛɛ ma tɛ gedi gɛ bee kuma ilifwi dʋkɔbɛ. Yotam na biri na sere Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gatala giitunu fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yonatan ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ ma ade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />(Awi ɩtɔkɔ yaanɩ gɛ Yahwe ɛɛ yɛ Asiriya wogyu Resin ma Remaliya wobi Peka be sere ɔpɩ bɛɛ ma tà bɩtà ma Yuda bete.) <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Yotam e ku gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɩsan baanɩ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ. Gɛ wobi Ahasi e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Ahasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />Remaliya wobi Peka bugyu buu gedi tɛ Isareli bete wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-kwarankɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yotam wobi Ahasi e sere bugyu buu gedi. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Ahasi e sere bugyu buu bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin, gɛ e di bugyu Isareli bɩkyan fwo-kooron. Ɛn tɛrɛma wotu Dafidi wade-mɛlɛ. Ɛn mɛ ade-kpara Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" />Ɛ tɛrɛma Isareli begyu boo-isele, gɛ e kuma wobi gba ɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi ɛ ka ɛ tɛrɛma ade-kyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe e berema e ye Isareli bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ bɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />Ɛɛ tɛ gedi, gɛ ee kuma olifwi asʋmakʋn, ma adenbi yii koro, ma oyon-kusuu-kamasɛ wʋʋ gatɩn.<verse eid="2KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />Ɔkʋna wʋkɩ fɔ, Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ Resin ma Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Peka gɛtɛ wote n di Remaliya fɔ bɛ san bàà ma sʋ Yerusalem ditele bɛ sa, fɔ bàà tà dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɩtà. Mɔ bɛn talɩ di dii koro. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Waanɩ fɔ, Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ Resin ɛ kpà e to Elati ditele fɔ e ye Yuda bete baakʋn ɛ tɛ Aram, gɛ Edom bete bɛ san bɛ ma sara dʋkɔ bè ye ma ǹdò.<verse eid="2KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Ahasiya ɛ sa bɛnɩ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ Tigilati-Pileseri wakʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ di gɛ aasaranyan ma aabi. Ba fɔ àà bè tiri mɩ ye Aram wogyu-dɩrɛ ma Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ tà mɩ bɩtà lɛ baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Gɛ Ahasi ɛ ka sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, ma ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa gigyu-bɩya gɩɩ gatɩn fɔ, bɛ ma tɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Gɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ nʋn wakʋn, gɛ ɛ ma tà Damasiko ditele bɩtà, gɛ e gye dɩ bɩtà. E tiri dɩɩ bɛnɩ e ye daanɩ ɛ san Kiri, gɛ e wolo Resin.<verse eid="2KI 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Ahasi ɛ san Damasiko ɛ ma tuma Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ Tigilati-Pileseri fɔ, e we gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn gɩkɩ Damasiko dʋkɔ, gɛ ɛ ka gɩɩ gɛta ma gɩɩ gɛmarabi-gbagbaagba ɛ tɩyɛma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Uriya. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Uriya ɛ mara gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn gɛtɛ giidu wʋ̀ bɔ wu we anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Ahasi ɛ ka ɛ tɩyɛma e ye Damasiko fɔ. Gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ ɛ mara gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ e were pɛgɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Ahasi e biri ɛ ba. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e ye Damasiko e be gyu, gɛ e we gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ, e kpe ɛ gbɛma gɩ, gɛ ɛ tɛ gedi gii koro. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />Ɛ tɛ gekuma ma anyan yaabi yii gedi, gɛ ɛ daa bʋkan e lù gii koro ɛ tɛ gedi, gɛ ɛ ka nkalan fɔ ɛ tɛ olila wuu gedi gii koro. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" />Gɛ ɛ kpema gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn gɛtɛ gi yela Yahwe bʋnʋn, Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn fɔ e ye gii geyelakʋn, gɛ ɛ ka gɩ ɛ ma yela gifufon fɔ gɩɩpɩ, gatala gɩɩ gɩlan. <verse eid="2KI 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Ahasi ɛ dɔ̀ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Uriya alan, &lt;&lt;Tɛ gagyɩgyan gii gekuma gii gedi ma ɔgyɔlɔ waanyan yaabi yii gedi, ma egyu-dɩrɛ wo gekuma gii gedi ma wanyan yaabi yii gedi, ma gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ powu gɩɩ bɛnɩ boo gekuma gii gedi ma bɔɔ bʋkan buu gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn-fon fɔ gii koro. Wʋʋ gama fɔ ka gekuma gii gedi gaanyan, ma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ yɩɩ nkalan fɔ powu ŋwan gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn-fon fɔ gii koro. Mɔ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ mɛ fɔ gàà yela tɛ mɩ nan tì ka n lila Yahwe gelenbi. <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Uriya ɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Ahasi ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />Gɛ egyu Ahasi e tiri iyon-pansan-pansan fɔ, gɛ e tiri bɛtasa-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gyaga yii koro fɔ. Ɛ tɔ̀là butu buu geto-sakʋn gɛtɛ gɩ̀ gyaga bɛkwɔ gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ mara fɔ boo koro fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka gɩ ɛ ma gyaga dɩtaa dii koro. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Gɛtɛ ee len wade yàà di Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ gʋnʋn okoro, e tiri duwi-tunalɛ dii gedi gɩɩpanpan gɛtɛ nafɔ be sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ e ye, gɛ ɛ sʋ otunu gɛtɛ Isareli wogyu ɛɛ ka e gyu Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Bɛ ŋwara Ahasi wade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ fɔ bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yaakpa yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" />Ahasi e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɩsan baanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ. Gɛ wobi Hesekiya e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu-kurumakyɛɛ Hoseya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Ahasi bugyu buu gedi bʋʋ gɩkyan-fwo-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Ela wobi Hoseya e be di bugyu ɛ tɛ Isareli gɛ ɛ sara Samariya. E di bugyu fɔ bɩkyan yɛkɩ. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn, mɔ nka kpekpesi anlɛ begyu gɛtɛ be gyegeye wɔ bɛ sara bɛ mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Waanɩ fɔ, Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ Salimaneseri ɛ ma tà Hoseya bɩtà, gɛ e di Hoseya wo koro. Okoro Hoseya ee tì le gutoro ɛ tɛ Salimaneseri gɩkyan-kamasɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Mɔ duwi dɩkɩ, Hoseya ɛ sa bɛsalɛ Egyipiti wogyu So wakʋn alɛ ee bugiti gɛkpà. Gɛ e kere gɩkyan gii gutoro gɛtɛ ee tì le ɛ tɛ Asiriya fɔ ɛ ya. Gɛtɛ Salimanaseri ɛ nʋn gɛlɛ gaade fɔ, ɛ yɛ bɛ ma gye Hoseya, gɛ bɛ tan wɔ dikwo. <verse eid="2KI 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Asiriya wogyu ɛ yɛ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be to Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa powu, gɛ bɛ sʋ Samariya bɛ sa bɩkyan bisiyee. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />Hoseya gɩkyan-yɛkɩfɛ gaanɩ gɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ e gye Samariya bɩtà, gɛ ɛ ka Isareli bete ɛ san Asiriya. Ɛ ka bɛ ɛ ma sɩ̀ Hala ditele daanɩ, ma Gosan gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ, gbɛma Habori getu, ma Mede bete baatele yaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli bete baade-kpen ɩ yɛ be gye bɛ bɛ san gɩdɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Isareli bete bɛ mɛ Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ e tiri bɛ e ye Egyipiti, ma Egyipiti wogyu-dɩrɛ Farawo gɛnyanla gaanɩ fɔ ade-kpen. Okoro gɛ ade nyayɩ powu ɩ ba boo koro lɛ. Bɛ sʋma bekpen, <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />gɛ bɛ tɛrɛma bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe e berema e ye bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ baade-mɛlɛ. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ bɛ mɛ ade-mɛlɛ gɛtɛ Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ bɛ ka bɛ ba fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Isareli bete bɛ mɛ Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ ade-kpen dibilin daanɩ, gɛtɛ wʋn mɛ wɔ ɔsɛ. Be sere asʋmakʋn baatele-buru-buru ma baatele-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" />Be sere akpen-taa ma Asera wo-iyon odon-kamasɛ wuu koro, ma oyon-kusaa-kamasɛ wʋʋ gatɩn. <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />Be kuma olifwi dɩsʋmakʋn-kamasɛ daanɩ anlɛ bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe e berema e ye bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ bɛ mɛ fɔ. Bɛ mɛ duyu-kɛma, gɛ wʋ sa Yahwe owurufa. <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />Ma gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ sʋ bɛ ɛ sa alɛ bɛ kara sʋma bekpen gba fɔ, bɛ sʋma bekpen. <verse eid="2KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" />Yahwe ɛ da ma wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ ma bewelɛ ade boo koro ɛ sʋ Isareli ma Yuda ɛ sa alan, &lt;&lt;I kere ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛmɛ ɩ ya! I tɛrɛma mii-ise ma maade-wùlàlɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Ose wʋʋ gɩkpa, gɛtɛ na da ma mɩɩn bɛsaranyan ma bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ boo koro na ka na tɛ yiitu ɛbɛ alɛ be di yii koro fɔ gaanɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Mɔ bɛn nʋn wakʋn, gɛ bɛ bɔ bɛ mɛ gɛ duyu-kɛma anlɛ gɛtɛ bootu ɛbɛ gɛtɛ ben to Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ di fɔ bɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Be terema wade-wùlàlɛ fɔ, ma dikola gɛtɛ ɛ tà ma bootu ɛbɛ fɔ, ma gɛsʋ gɛtɛ ɛ sʋ bɛ ɛ sa fɔ. Bɛ tɛrɛma bekpen gɛtɛ bɛn ma tɔnɔ, gɛ ɛbɛ mɔ be biligi bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛn ma tɔnɔ. Ma gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ bɛ kara mɛ ade gɛtɛ bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ bu silin bɛ bu tuma fɔ bʋʋ mɛ gba fɔ, bɛ mɛ yɩ.<verse eid="2KI 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" />Be kere Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ wo-ise fɔ bɛ ya, gɛ bɛ mara akwɔbi anyɔɔ bɛ mɛ bekpen bɛ tɛ koro, gɛ be sere Asera woyon. Be kura anyan gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa gatala fɔ, gɛ bɛ sʋma Baali. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" />Be kuma boo bebi-teni ma bɛnanɩ bɛ tɛ gedi. Bɛ mɛ gɛsɔma ma asɔlɔ-de, gɛ be fu koro bɛ tɛ ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛmɛ Yahwe bʋnʋn baanɩ bɛ ka bɛ sa wɔ owurufa.<verse eid="2KI 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Okoro Yahwe ɛ ka owurufa Isareli bete boo koro, gɛ e tiri bʋnʋn ɛ yɛ bɛ, gɛ wʋ yɛ wu kuruma gɛ Yuda bete booko. <verse eid="2KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />Gɛ Yuda bete gba ben ton Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ wo-ise fɔ yaanɩ. Bɛ tɛrɛma ade-mɛlɛ gɛtɛ Isareli ɛ ka ɛ ba fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Okoro Yahwe e terema Isareli bete powu. E tiira bɛ giten, gɛ ɛ ka bɛ ɛ sa bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ, ka ma sere gɛtɛ e berema bɛ e ye wɔ bʋnʋn.<verse eid="2KI 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />Ɔkʋna wʋkɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ lanla Isareli e ye Dafidi wodu waanɩ fɔ, Isareli bete bɛ ka Nebati wobi Yerobwam be sɩ̀ bugyu. Gɛ Yerobwam ɛ gban bɛ be kere Yahwe dɩsʋma bɛ ya gɛtɛ wʋ yɛ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Isareli bete fɔ bɛ tɛrɛma Yerobwam, gɛ be ton baade-kpen powu gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ yaanɩ <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />ma sere gamama gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ bɛ bɛ ka bɛ be ye wɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ bɔ ɛ da ma wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ boo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. Okoro bɛ ka Isareli bete be ye ɛbɛ gbagba bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ bɛ bɛ ma sɩ̀ gisela Asiriya gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ, gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sangba bɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ ka bɛnɩ-kperen bɛ bɛ sɩ̀ Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ka bɛnɩ e ye Babilon, ma Kuta, ma Afa, ma Hamati, ma Sefarifayim atele yaanɩ ɛ bɛ sɩ̀ Samariya watele yaanɩ ɛ ka e sere Isareli bete bɔɔ gɩsɩrɩ. Be to Samariya gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ bɛ sara watele yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ dàà gyu dʋkɔ fɔ, bɛn sʋma Yahwe, okoro Yahwe ɛ sa bɛdɩrɛ bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ, gɛ be wolo baanɩ bɛkɩ. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Okoro bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ yɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ nʋn ade fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ a tɔ̀là bɛ a ma sɩ̀ Samariya watele yaanɩ fɔ bɛɛn nyɩ gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ giikpen wade-lenlɛ. Okoro ekpen fɔ ɛ sa bɛdɩrɛ bɛ ba baanɩ, gɛ bee wolo bɛ yema bɛnɩ fɔ bɛɛn nyɩ̀ ekpen fɔ wade-lenlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ma ka gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ i gye bɩtà i ye Samariya fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ, i birima ɩ san ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma sara dʋkɔ, fɔ èè wùlà bɛnɩ fɔ bookpen fɔ dɩsʋma daade.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Okoro gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ be gye be ye Samariya bɛ ma sɩ̀ gisela fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛ ma sara Beteli, gɛ e wùlà bɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ baà ka bɛ sʋma Yahwe.<verse eid="2KI 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Mɔ ginde-kamasɛ gɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ ɛbɛ gbagba boo bekpen atele gɛtɛ bè si fɔ yaanɩ. Bɛ mɛ-mɛ bekpen bɛ sa akpen-kwo gɛtɛ ɩ̀ fʋrʋma ɩ̀ sa Samariya wasʋmakʋn fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Babilon bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ ekpen Sukoti-Benoti, gɛ Kuta bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ ekpen Nerigali, gɛ Hamati bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ ekpen Asima. <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />Afa bete bɛ mɛ bekpen Nibihasi ma Taritaki, gɛ Sefarifi bete be kuma boo bebi ɔtan waanɩ bɛ tɛ Sefarifi bete boo bekpen Adarameliki ma Anameleki gedi. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />Gɛtɛ bɛɛ sʋma Yahwe fɔ, be ni tiri ɛbɛ gbagba bɔɔ bɛnɩ bɛkɩ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn bɛ tɛ bɛ akpen-kwo yaanɩ anlɛ bekpente asʋmakʋn fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Gɛtɛ bɛɛ sʋma Yahwe fɔ, bɛɛ nɩ sʋma boo bekpen anlɛ gɛtɛ boo geyekʋn giidu waade-mɛlɛ ii wùlà fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" />Bɛ̀ sangba bè de baade-mɛlɛ-kuba ɩtɔkɔ bè ye ma ǹdò. Bɛn taa sʋma Yahwe, gɛ bɛn taa tɛrɛma wade-mɛlɛ ma wade-wùlàlɛ, ma ade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ, ma ise gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ tɛ Yakobu gɛtɛ ɛ sa diyere alɛ Isareli wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ tà dikola ma Isareli bete fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kara sʋma bekpen, abɛɛ yàà kura bɛ, abɛɛ yàà tɛ bɛ gedi. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" />Mɔ Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ ka wɔkɛma-dɩrɛ ma wɔ gʋlɔ ma ɔkɛma e tiri yɩ e ye Egyipiti fɔ gɛ wù di gɛtɛ yàà sʋma. Ɛwɔ gɛ yaà kura, gɛ ɛwɔ gɛ yaà tɛ gedi. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Wù gɛtɛ yàà ton ade-wùlàlɛ, ma ade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ, ma ade-wùlàlɛ, ma ise gɛtɛ ɛ ŋwara ɛ tɛ yɩ fɔ yaanɩ ɔya-kamasɛ. Ɩ kara sʋma bekpen! <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />Ɩ kara finla dikola gɛtɛ na tà ma ɛyɩ fɔ, gɛ ɩ kara sʋma bekpen. <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />Mɔ fɔ ɩ sʋma gɛ nmɩ Yahwe, yii Wurubwarɛ fɔ! Wù di gɛ nmɩ nan tiri yɩ n ye yɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 17:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Mɔ bɛn nʋn wakʋn, be ton gɛ bɔɔ dɩsarabi-kuba fɔ daade-mɛlɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Ma gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛɛ sʋma Yahwe gba fɔ, bɛɛ nɩ sʋma boo bekpen mɔ. bè ye ma ǹdò, boo bebi ma bɔɔ bɛnana bɛ̀ sangba bɛɛ sʋma bekpen anlɛ gɛtɛ bootu ɛbɛ bɛ sʋma fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Ela wobi Hoseya gɩkyan-siyeefɛ gaanɩ gɛ Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Ahasi wobi Hesekiya e sere bugyu buu gedi. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ e sere bugyu buu gedi fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton, gɛ e di bugyu fɔ Yerusalem bɩkyan dikpilin ma yɛkɩ. Wɔna diyere n di Abiya, gɛtɛ è di Sekariya wobi-nanɩbi fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ wotu Dafidi ɛ bɔ ɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" />E gbena asʋmakʋn fɔ, gɛ e gbena akpen-taa fɔ, gɛ e sila Asera wo-iyon fɔ ɛ fɩna. E gbena gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gɩɩwa gɛtɛ Mose ɛ mɛ gɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Nehusitan fɔ buruburu, yema bè sere ma ɔya wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, Isareli bete bɛ̀ sangba bee kuma olifwi bɛ tɛ wɔ.<verse eid="2KI 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Hesekiya e to Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ e di. Yuda begyu powu gɛtɛ bɛ sara pɛgɛ ɛ ba, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà bɛ ba wɔ gama powu baanɩ fɔ, ɛkɩ en to di anlɛ ɛwɔ. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />Ɛ bɔ ɛ kpà ɛ marama Yahwe, gɛtɛ en kere wɔ gɛtɛrɛma ya. E ton ise gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ tɛ Mose fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" />Okoro Yahwe ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ, gɛ ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ i pe ɩ tɛ wɔ. E tɔ e yela Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ wo koro gɛtɛ ɛn mɩnɩ sʋma wɔ. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Ɛ kpà e di Filisiti bete boo koro. E di Gasa ma watele gɛtɛ i silin wɔ i tuma fɔ yii koro. E di atele-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ ma atele-buru-buru fɔ yii koro.<verse eid="2KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-naafɛ gaanɩ, gɛtɛ wù di Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Ela wobi Hoseya, gɩkyan-kwarankɩ fɛ fɔ, Asiriya wogyu Salimaneseri ɛ tɔ e yela Samariya wo koro gɛ ɛ ma sʋ wɔ ɛ sa. <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />Bɩkyan busiyee buu gewere gaanɩ fɔ, Asiriya e to Samariya. Okoro be gye Samariya bɩtà Hesekiya gɩkyan-kooronfɛ gaanɩ, gɛtɛ wù di Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Hoseya gɩkyan yɛkɩfɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Gɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ ka Isareli bete bɛkɩ bɛ san Asiriya, gɛ bɛ ka bɛkɩ bɛ ma sɩ̀ Hala ditele daanɩ, bɛ ka bɛkɩ bɛ ma sɩ Gosan wɔlanlan gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Habo getu gɩɩpɩ fɔ, ma Medesi watele yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />Ade nyayɩ i sere boo koro yema bɛn nʋn Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ ginde, ben di dikola gɛtɛ ɛ tà ma ɛbɛ fɔ dii koro. Ise powu gɛtɛ Yahwe wɔsaranyan Mose ɛ tɛ bɛ fɔ, bɛn ka yɩ bɩta, gɛ ben di yii koro.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />Hesekiya bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-naafɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ Senakeribii ɛ ma tà bɩtà ma Yuda watele ma ɔkɛma fɔ, gɛ e gye yɩ bɩtà. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya ɛ tɩyɛma Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Na mɛ ade-kpen. Kere mɩ gɛnyanla ya, nan le wɔ̀ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ aà lila fɔ.&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Asiriya wogyu e belen gutoro ɛ sɩ̀ wɔ gɛtɛ èè le sɩka-fututu gɛtɛ wɔdʋrʋ wù ba siminti bɛbagɩ gɛkpɩn ma dikpilin bɔɔdʋrʋ, ma sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ wɔdʋrʋ wù di siminti bɛbagɩ dikpilin bɔɔdʋrʋ. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Okoro Hesekiya ɛ ka sɩka-fututu powu gɛtɛ be wura Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ, ma digyu-kpaara dɩɩ dɩdaka daanɩ fɔ ɛ tɛ wɔ.<verse eid="2KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya ɛ magɩ sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ ɛ̀ marama ɩpʋnʋn fɔ, ma sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ ɛ tɩ̀ ka ɛ bɔlɩ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ dii-itunu-yon fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka wɔ ɛ tɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ.<verse eid="2KI 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Senakeribi ɛ nyanla Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ boo duyu, ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bʋʋndɩrɛ, ma akpà yiigyegeyelɛ fɩya ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ kpekpesi e ye Lakisi bɛ san Hesekiya wakʋn Yerusalem ditele daanɩ. Gɛtɛ be gyu Yerusalem fɔ, be to ɔkʋn gɛtɛ butu bʋʋ kyalɩ, ngba buuferelɛ woli-sele ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bɛnanɩ bee fere anyan fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Gɛtɛ bɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ma kpèlè egyu fɔ, Hilikiya wobi Eliyakim gɛtɛ è di digyu-kpaara dɩɩnyalɛ fɔ, ma Sebina gɛtɛ è di gɩkpa gɩɩŋwarɛlɛ fɔ, ma egyu wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Yowa gɛtɛ è di Asafi wobi fɔ na ma tuma bɛ.<verse eid="2KI 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Asiriya bete boogyu-dɩrɛ-kpatakpɩrɩ ee lila alan, &lt;Anʋn gbagba yii koro gɛ aa bʋnʋn bʋ̀ gyaga? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />Aa dɔ̀ gɛtɛ à nyɩ̀ isele gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka bɛ kpà, gɛ à ba bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba ɔkɛma. Mɔ aanyun-gyebi ì di gɛ onyun-foli waade. Ɛnyan gɛ aa bʋnʋn bʋ̀ gyaga wo koro gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ kpà wɔ̀ àà tɔ yela miin koro? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />Nya! À de bʋnʋn aa gyaga Egyipiti wogyu wo koro. Egyipiti wogyu è we gɛ anlɛ gɛkyɛrɛbayɩ gɛtɛ gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ ka ɛ mɛ oyon-tonlɛ fɔ, gaà tu wɔ aalɔ. Anlɛ gɛ Egyipiti wogyu Farawo ɛɛ mɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ee len gɛkpà e ye wakʋn fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />Gɛ gengyi à dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ aa bʋnʋn bʋ̀ gyaga Yahwe, aa Wurubwarɛ wo koro fɔ, nka wasʋmakʋn ma wo gedi gaatɛkʋn gɛ Hesekiya e gbena, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Yuda ma Yerusalem bete alan, &lt;&lt;Yerusalem gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn giiko gɛ yaà sʋma&gt;&gt; fɔ?<verse eid="2KI 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />Awɔ ba, fɔ awɔ ma miinfonte Asiriya wogyu yàà dɔ̀ i yera bɛwɔlɔn. Gengyi awɔ aà nyɩ̀ a wura abengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ fɔ, nan tɛ wɔ̀ abengyi gbaa (2,000). <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Ma gɛtɛ aa bʋnʋn bʋ̀ gyaga Egyipiti wo koro gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ tɛ wɔ̀ tiiramisan ɛbɛ, ma abengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ gba fɔ, an nan talɩ a yela ma miinfonte wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ baanɩ ɛpɩɩ fɔ gba. <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />À nyɩ̀ alɛ Yahwe ɛn fɩya ma nmɩ, gɛ na ba nan bɛ̀ tà aa gɩfɩɩ bɩtà, fɔ nan muru gɩ? Yahwe gbagba na dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ n bɛ tà gɩfɩɩ fɔ bɩtà, fɔ nan muru gɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hilikiya wobi Eliyakim ma Sebina ma Yowa bɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ wɔkpàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩɩ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, tabʋrʋ ma ɛtɩ aa bɛsaranyan Aram bete boo ginde gaanɩ, yema tɩɩ nʋn gɩ. Kara tabʋrʋ ma ɛtɩ Hebere ginde gaanɩ gɛtɛ wàà bɛ̀ yɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gyaga ɔpɔrɩ wuu koro fɔ bàà bɛ̀ nʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Mɔ egyu wɔkpàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;À nyɩ̀ alɛ ɛyɩ ma yiifonte yiiko gɛ miinfonte ɛ sa mɩ alɛ ǹ bɛ dɔ̀ ade nyayɩ n tɛ? N tɛ tabʋrʋ n tɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè si ɔpɔrɩ wuu koro fɔ ke. Ɛbɛ mɔ ke baà di baapʋn, fɔ bàà nyʋn baalɩla anlɛ ɛyɩ mɔ ke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛkpàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ fɔ e kpe ɛ san bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala hebre bete boo ginde gaanɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nʋn Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ, egyu-dɩrɛ-kpatakpɩrɩ wanyun-gyebi! <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛɛ dɔ̀ alɛ ɩ kara yɛ Hesekiya ɛ̀ɛ̀ gban yɩ. Ɛn nan talɩ e to yɩ e ye maalɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Ɩ kara yɛ Hesekiya ɛ̀ɛ̀ yɛ yɩɩ bʋnʋn bàà gyaga Yahwe wo koro. Ɩ kara mɛ amɩnlɛ alɛ, &lt;Yahwe eè to yɩ ɛ ya, fɔ yàà dɔ̀ alɛ Asiriya bete bɛn nan talɩ be gye ditele nyadɩ.&gt;<verse eid="2KI 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />Ɩ kara nʋn Hesekiya wakʋn! Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛɛ dɔ̀ alɛ, i ye ditele fɔ daanɩ ɩ ba, fɔ yàà bɛ̀ ka koro tɛ. Ɛwʋ fɔ, yaanɩ-kamasɛ eè di e ye wɔ wayɩn ma wo figi yii-ili yaanɩ gɛ ɛɛ̀ nyʋn ɛwɔ gbagba wo ditiribun dii butu. <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />ma sere gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka yɩ ɛ san gɛtʋnkwaa gɩkɩ gɛtɛ gì we anlɛ yiiyo nyagɩ lɛ gaanɩ. Wayin, ma anyandilɛ ma wayɩn wo-ili, ma olife wo-iyon ma ɛŋɔɔ ɩ̀ sa gaanɩ. I tiri nkpa, fɔ ɩ kara ku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 18:32">Ɩ kara nʋn Hesekiya wakʋn yema gengyi ɛɛ dɔ̀ yɩ alɛ Yahwe eè to yɩ ɛ ya fɔ, yaà lulu osele. <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />Gɩfɩɩ gɩkɩ giikpen e were to gɩ e ye Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ gʋlɔ gaanɩ ɛ nya? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Hamati ma Aripadi boo bekpen bɛ̀ sa gaanɩ? Sefarifayim, ma Hena ma Ifa boo bekpen de? Ekpen ɛkɩ e to Samariya e ye mɩɩn gʋlɔ gaanɩ ɛ nya? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Bɩfɩɩ nyabʋ powu buu bekpen baanɩ fɔ, ekpen-mɔmɔ na talɩ ɛ kpà e to wɔ gɩfɩɩ e ye miin gʋlɔ gaanɩ ɛ nya? Gɛ lan gɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ talɩ e to Yerusalem e ye miin gʋlɔ gaanɩ ɛ nya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Mɔ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ kʋn yiridi gɛtɛ bɛn dɔ ade ɩkɩ, yema egyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya ɛ tɛ bɛ ose alɛ bɛ kara tiri wuunyun.<verse eid="2KI 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hilikiya wobi Eliyakim gɛtɛ è di digyu-kpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ fɔ, ma egyu gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Sebina, ma Asafi wobi Yowa gɛtɛ è di egyu wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ, be gye bɔɔ-ngba bɛ fɛɛran, gɛ bɛ ma kasɩ ade gɛtɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ wɔkpàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ fɔ bɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛ dɔ̀ Yerusalem getoya gaade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya ɛ nʋn gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ fɔ, e gye wɔ ngba ɛ fɛɛran, gɛ ɛ sa disepekyi daanyan, gɛ ɛ san ɛ da Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ yɛ ɛndɩrɛbi Eliyakim gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya digyu-kpaara dii koro fɔ, ma gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Sebina, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ be liba asepekyi yaayan, gɛ ɛ sa bɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Isaya gɛtɛ è di Amosi wobi fɔ wakʋn. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Hesekiya alɛ ǹdò wuu duwi nyadɩ dì di gɛ koro gii gegye, ma giten-tiira, ma ɩnɩnfa yii duwi. Wʋ̀ bɔ wù we anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛnanɩ ɛɛ dɩma gɛtɛ èè wo, mɔ ɔkɛma wʋn ma wɔ gɛtɛ èè wo fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Nkɩfɔ Yahwe, aa Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛɛ̀ nʋn egyu bɩtà buugyegeyelɛ nyawɔ wade gɛtɛ wofonte Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa wɔ ɛ ba ɛɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sa Nkpa wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɩnɩnfa lɛ, fɔ èè tiira wɔ giten wanyun-gyebi gɛtɛ Yahwe, aa Wurubwarɛ ɛ nʋn lɛ yii koro. Okoro tiri onyun tɛ bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sangba bè si nkpa fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ be gyu Isaya wakʋn fɔ, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" />Isaya ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ dɔ̀ yiifonte alɛ, &lt;Yahwe alɛ ɩ kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton yɩ ma nbusu ade gɛtɛ ɩ nʋn Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ba bɛɛ dɔ̀ yɩ alɛ mɩɩn nan talɩ n to yi n ya lɛ. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />Ɩ nʋn! Nan yɛ sunsun ɛkɩ èè gyu wanɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ nʋn ade-nʋnlɛ ɩkɩ, gɛtɛ yaà yɛ wɔ èè serenti da ɛwɔ gbagba wɔ gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. Dʋkɔ fɔ nan yɛ wɔ èè ku ma edon.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Gɛtɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ wɔ bɩtà buugyegeyelɛ fɔ ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ Asiriya wogyu e ye Lakisi ɛ san ɛɛ tà Libina bɩtà fɔ, ɛwɔ mɔ ɛ san ɛ ma tàmà wɔ dʋkɔ.<verse eid="2KI 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ Senakeribi ɛ nʋn alɛ Egyipiti wogyu-dɩrɛ, Kusi-te Tiraka ɛɛ ba ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ̀ kpà ma ɛwɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ sa bɛnɩ Hesekiya wakʋn alɛ, <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />bɛ ma dɔ̀ Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Kara yɛ ekpen gɛtɛ aa bʋnʋn bʋ̀ gyaga wo koro gɛtɛ ɛɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alɛ ɛn nan ka Yerusalem ɛ sa Asiriya wogyu gʋlɔ fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ gban wɔ̀. <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Nya nka a nʋn ade gɛtɛ Asiriya begyu-dɩrɛ bɛ mɛ bɩfɩɩ powu, be muru bʋ kɩrɩ-kɩrɩ. Gɛ awɔ aa to a di alɛ aà ye waanɩ? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />Gɛtɛ miintu ɛbɛ be muru Gosan, ma Haran, ma Resefi yaatele, ma Eden bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Tel-Asari fɔ, boo bekpen be to bɛ bɛ ya? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Ganɩ gɛ Hamati wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ sa? Ganɩ gɛ Aripadi wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ sa? Ganɩ gɛ Sefarfayim ditele diigyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ sa? gɛ Hena ma Ifa boo begyu de?<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hesekiya wonyun-tiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Hesekiya e to gɩkpa fɔ e ye bɛnɩ-salɛ fɔ baakʋn, gɛ ɛ kalan gɩ. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ bʋn ɛ san Yahwe dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ yaraba gɩ ɛ sɩ̀ Yahwe bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Gɛ Hesekiya e tiri onyun alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ à si gigyu-bɩya gii koro Kerubi ɛbɛ boo getite, aako-kwan n di Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ aa di bugyu, bugyu-bugyu gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ powu buu koro. Awɔ na mɛ gatala ma gɛtʋnkwaa. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />Oo, Yahwe, ken giten, fɔ àà nʋn! Tirima bʋnʋn, fɔ àà nya! Nʋn anyun-gyebi gɛtɛ Senakeribi ɛɛ dɔ̀ ɛ ka e toro awɔ Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ à si nkpa gakpaakpa fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />Oo, Yahwe, wʋ̀ sa waanɩ gɛtɛ Asiriya wogyu e muru bɩfɩɩ nyabʋ powu ma bʋʋ ntʋnkwaa. <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />Be fun boo bekpen bɛ sa ɔtan waanɩ, gɛ be muru bɛ, mɔ bè di gɛ bekpen gɛtɛ bɛnɩ-nyalɛ na ka iyon ma ataa nan mɛ bɛ. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />Okoro, oo Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ, tiri tɩ ye Asiriya bete baalɔ yaanɩ, fɔ bugyu-bugyu gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ powu fɔ bàà nyɩnla alɛ awɔ Yahwe aako-kwan n di Wurubwarɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isaya ɛ dɔ̀ ade ka dama Senakeribi gɛnʋ̀n</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Amosi wobi Isaya ɛ sa Hesekiya ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe, Isareli bete boo Wurubwarɛ alan, &lt;Na nʋn aanyun-tiri gɛtɛ a tiri a tɛ mɩ ka da ma Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ Saneheribi wo koro fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Ade gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ ka dama wo koro fɔ n di alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Siyon wobi-nanɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛn nyɩ̀ ete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">en bù wɔ̀, gɛ ɛɛ mʋmwa wɔ̀.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Yerusalem wobi-nanɩ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">e terema wɔ̀ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ aa serenti fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />Ɛnyan gɛ aa toro, gɛ a dɔ̀ nbusu ade a gyaga wo koro?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Ɛnyan gɛ aa bʋma gɩta wo koro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">gɛ aa nya wɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ a bʋma koro?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛwɔ n di Ɛfɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ gɛ an taa bù lɛ!<verse eid="2KI 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />A da ma aa bɛnɩ-salɛ boo koro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">a firin atuyerebi a lù Efonte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Gɛ a dɔ̀ alan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">&lt;&lt;Na ka miin tiiramisan ɛbɛ kpekpesi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">na bʋn idon yaayu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">na bʋn na san Lebano wo-idon-tɔlɛ yii koro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Na kebi seda wo-iyon ma abo fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">ma siperesi wo-iyon-kpara fɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Na gyu na san gii getenkʋn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">ma ɔkʋn gɛtɛ gɩkan fɔ gi gyu gɩ kaara fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />Na kunla ɩlɔkɔ ntʋnkwaa-fon baanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">gɛ na nyʋn butu dʋkɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">Mɩɩn bɩsɩrɩ buu gekyikya-kyikya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">wʋ yɛ Egyipiti watu ɩ nyʋn.<verse eid="2KI 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />An nʋn nya gɛtɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">na fʋrʋma na tɩyɛ ade ɩtɔkɔ na sɩ̀?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Na fʋrʋma na nyɩ̀ gʋlɔ ade nyayɩ yii koro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">Nkele na yɛ wʋ ba waanɩ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">gɛtɛ a yɛ atele ma ɔkɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">i biligi atìngbìlìn.<verse eid="2KI 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Bɔɔ bɛnɩ fɔ ben wura ɔkɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">gɩsaa gi ton bɛ, gɛ ɩnɩnfa i di bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Bè we anlɛ oli waanɩ wʋʋ dɩfa-ŋɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">anlɛ dɩfa gɛtɛ dɩɩn ma ɔkɛma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">anlɛ dɩfa gɛtɛ dii ye dikwo dii duyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">gɛtɛ dii ku pɛ wàà bè dɔ̀ alɛ wʋʋ dan.<verse eid="2KI 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />&lt;&lt;Mɔ ǹ nyɩ̀ aa gɛsara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">ma aa gegyu, ma aa geye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">ma aawurufa gɛtɛ aa ka miin koro.<verse eid="2KI 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />Gɛtɛ aa ka owurufa miin koro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">gɛ aa koro gɩɩ gɛbʋma gaade ɩ bɛ tàmà mɩ okoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">nan ka miin gitola n sa wɔ̀ dininfere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">gɛ nan ka mɩɩn gɩwɔrɔnyan n sa aanyun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">fɔ nan yɛ wɔ̀ àà biri da</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">ma osele gɛtɛ a ka a ba fɔ.&gt;<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />Oo, Hesekiya, ade gɛtɛ aà ka a we a nyɩnla fɔ n di gɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">&lt;&lt;Gɩkyan nyagɩ, aà di gɛ anyan gɛtɛ ɛyɩ gbagba na ye yaanyan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">Gɩkyan-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ, aà di gɛ abi gɛtɛ ɩ kpʋkpa ɩ nʋ̀n gɩkyan-gyangbasɛ, gɛ i ye fɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">Mɔ gɩkyan-siyeefɛ fɔ, ɩ dɔ, fɔ yàà sila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">ɩ dɔ wayɩn wabi, fɔ yàà di yɩ.<verse eid="2KI 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Yuda bɛnɩ gɛtɛ baà kuruma fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:30">baà sere ɩkpaa, gɛ baà lʋn abi.<verse eid="2KI 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Yema bɛnɩ baà kuruma bɛ sara nkpa gɛtɛ be ye Yerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:31">Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà kuruma bɛ sara nkpa fɔ, baà yela be ye Siyon wodon wuu koro.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2KI 19:31">Yahwe, ɔkɛma powu wuute fɔ wo gelenbi nan mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ.<verse eid="2KI 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />Okoro ade gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ ka dama Asiriya wo koro fɔ n di alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:32">&lt;&lt;Ɛn nan gyu ditele nyadɩ daanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">abɛɛ èè fun gɩtà gɩkɩ nfan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:32">Ɛn nan kpe ɛ gbɛma dɩ ma gɩwɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ koro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">abɛɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sʋ dɩ sa.<verse eid="2KI 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Ma osele gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ ba fɔ gɛ ɛɛ̀ ka e biri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">Ɛn nan gyu ditele nyadɩ daanɩ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">Anlɛ gɛ Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀.<verse eid="2KI 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />Nan dɩyɛ ditele nyadɩ, fɔ nan to dɩ n ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:34">nmɩ gbagba ma mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi tii koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />Odente wʋtɔkɔ, Yahwe wɔsalɛ ɛ ma wolo Asiriya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi yɛkɩ ma ɩgbaa ɩnyɔɔ ma nkpɩn ton (185,000) Asiriya bete bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn gaanɩ. Gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ lama gagyɩgyan fɔ, bɛnɩ na ku bɛ̀ fɩna bɛ̀ fɩna. <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Okoro Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ Senakeribi ɛ tɔ e ye gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ e biri ɛ da Ninefe ɛ ma sara dʋkɔ.<verse eid="2KI 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Duwi dɩkɩ, gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa wokpen Nisiro dikwo daanɩ ɛɛ sʋma fɔ, wo bebi Adirameleki ma Shareseri bɛ ma wolo wɔ ma boo bedon, gɛ be serenti bɛ da Ararati gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ. Gɛ wobi Esaradon e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Egyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya geyeba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Hesekiya e be gyu geyeba gɛtɛ ɛ̀ dɔ diku diiyo. Gɛ Amosi wobi Isaya gɛtɛ è di Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ san wakʋn gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Pɩna aa dɩkpaara sɩ̀ yema aà ku, an nan tɔ a ye geyeba nyagɩ gaanɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hesekiya e fi wɔ bʋnʋn e ten ɔpɔrɩ gɛ e tiri onyun ɛ tɛ Yahwe alan, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />&lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe, n fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, kʋna anlɛ gɛtɛ na tɛrɛma wɔ̀ nʋnkwarɩ anɩ, gɛ na ka miinturu powu na sʋma wɔ̀, gɛ na mɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ aa bʋnʋn baanɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Hesekiya e wula gepepe.<verse eid="2KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Pɛ Isaya èè kpe ye digyukpaara dɩɩ kpata-getitelɛ fɔ, Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />&lt;&lt;Biri san ma dɔ̀ Hesekiya, mɩɩn bɛnɩ boogyegeyelɛ fɔ alan, &lt;Yahwe, aatu Dafidi wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nʋn aanyun-tiri gɛ na we aa bunun-tu. Nan kya wɔ̀ geyeba. Awi asiyee yaanɩ fɔ, aà san Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />Nan ka bɩkyan fwo ton n fɩya aa nkpa wawi yaanɩ. Gɛ nan tiri awɔ ma ditele nyadɩ n ye Asiriya wogyu walɔ yaanɩ. Nan dɩyɛ ditele nyadɩ, nmɩ ma mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi tii koro.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isaya ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kpààrà figi ɩ bɛ sʋrʋ Esekiya woserelɛ fɔ wo koro.&gt;&gt; Gɛ bɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, gɛ e wura geyeba gɩɩ gɛkya.<verse eid="2KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Hesekiya e lila Isaya alan, &lt;&lt;Dɩdawʋ-mɔmɔ nan wùlà alɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ kya mɩ geyeba, gɛ nfan awi asiyee fɔ, nan talɩ n san Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Isaya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛɛ̀ tɛ wɔ̀ dɩdawʋ gɛtɛ daà wùlà alɛ ɛɛ̀ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ. À len gɛtɛ bilibili fɔ èè kpe san bʋnʋn akyɩkya-bʋnkʋn fwo abɛɛ èè ye gama akyɩkya-bʋnkʋn fwo?<verse eid="2KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hesekiya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋn ma ɔkɛma gɛtɛ bilibili fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san bʋnʋn bɩsɩrɩ fwo de! Okoro yɛ wɔ èè biri gama bɩsɩrɩ fwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Isaya e tiri onyun e kpèlè Yahwe, gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ ɛkala fɔ e kpe e ye gama bɩsɩrɩ fwo ɛ ma sere Ahasi gɛtɛ e sere fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ sa bɛnɩ be ye Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Babilon wogyu Baladan wobi Merodaki-Baladan ɛ nʋn Hesekiya geyeba. Gɛlɛ wuu koro ɛ ŋwara akpa fɩya ma anyan-kyɛlɛ, gɛ ɛ sa bɛnɩ alɛ bɛ ka bɛ ma tɛ wɔ.<verse eid="2KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Hesekiya e to bɛnɩ-salɛ fɔ, gɛ e wùlà bɛ anyan powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ dɔ̀ wo dikwo-sɩ̀lɛ anyan daanɩ fɔ. E wùlà bɛ wɔ sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya, ma anyan ma ofen ma bʋnɔ-kpara, ma wakpanyan ma wanyan gbaa-gbaa powu. Gɩnyankɩ gin kuruma wo digyukpaara daanɩ abɛɛ wo bugyu buu gedikʋn gɛtɛ Hesekiya en wùlà bɛ.<verse eid="2KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Isaya ɛ san egyu Hesekiya wakʋn gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade-mɔmɔ gɛ bɛnɩ nyabɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀? Gɛ gaanɩ gɛ be ye?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:14">Gɛ Hesekiya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Be ye ɔkʋn ma ɔfɔ wʋkɩ, be ye Babilon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ be we aa digyukpaara fɔ daanɩ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:15">Hesekiya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Be we gɩnyan-kamasɛ miin digyukpaara daanɩ. Gɩnyankɩ gin kuruma anyan-gbaa-gbaa gɛtɛ ǹ ba fɔ yaanɩ gɛtɛ min wùlà bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isaya ɛ dɔ̀ Hesekiya alan, &lt;&lt;Nʋn Yahwe wanyun-gyebi! <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" />Ɔya wʋkɩ waà bɛ ba gɛtɛ baà kpila anyan gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa aa digyukpaara, ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ aatu ɛbɛ bɛ pɩna bɛ sɩ̀ bè ye ma ǹdò fɔ powu bɛ da Babilon. Gɩnyankɩ gɩn nan kuruma. Gɛlɛ gɛ Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀.<verse eid="2KI 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" />Nkele mɔ, baà gye awɔ gbagba aadu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛkɩ dɩkpankpasan daanɩ bɛ san dʋkɔ, baà tiri bɛ aforobi, bàà sara Babilon wogyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara daanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hesekiya ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe wanyun-gyebi gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ fɔ ɩ̀ kɔlɔ.&gt;&gt; Yema Hesekiya ɛ nʋn gɛ ade fɔ yaanɩ alɛ olila ma koro gɩɩ gɛnʋ̀n yaà sara wɔ nkpa wawi powu yaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Bɛ ŋwara Hesekiya wade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma wade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ powu, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ imini-serelɛ gɛtɛ ii to butu, ma omini gɛtɛ e kunla gɛ wuu tiira butu wʋ ba ditele daanɩ fɔ powu bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Hesekiya e ku gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɩsàn baanɩ. Gɛ wobi-teni Manase e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Manase e sere bugyu buu bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan fwo-bʋnyɔɔ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo ton. Wɔna diyere n di Hefisiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" />Manase ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn. Ɛ tɛrɛma ade kyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe e berema e ye Isareli bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ bɛɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />E biri e sere asʋmakʋn gɛtɛ wote Hesekiya e gbena fɔ, gɛ e biri e sere Baali gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn ma Asera wo-iyon anlɛ gɛtɛ Isareli wogyu Ahabi ɛ mɛ fɔ. Ɛ sʋma gatala gaanyan. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" />E sere bekpen baadi yɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yerusalem nan mɛ mɩɩn gɛsʋmakʋn&gt;&gt; fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />E sere gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn ɛ tɛ gatala gaanyan yɩɩ gɛsʋma Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daakpaara anyɔɔ fɔ powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />E kuma ɛwɔ gbagba wobi-teni ɛ tɛ gedi. Ɛ mɛ asɔlɔ-de, ɛ sɔma gɛ ɛ san bɛbwɔ, ma bɛfa-te baakʋn, e kpèlè bekpena, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛnɩ gefuraba gaade. Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn baanɩ ɛ ka ɛ sa wɔ owurufa.<verse eid="2KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Ɛ ka oyon salɩlɛ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ yela tɛ Asera fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi ma wobi Solomon alan, &lt;&lt;Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ ma Yerusalem gɛtɛ na tiri na ye Isareli wo-ifoli powu yaanɩ lɛ nan mɛ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ baà tɩ sʋma mɩ gakpaakpa fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Gɛ gengyi Isareli bete baà mɛ ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ bɛ, gɛ baà di miin-ise powu gɛtɛ mɩɩnsaranyan Mose ɛ tɛ bɛ fɔ yii koro fɔ, mɩn nan yɛ bɛ bàà ye gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ na ka na tɛ bootu ɛbɛ fɔ gaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Mɔ Yuda bete bɛn nʋn Yahwe wakʋn. Manase ɛ yɛ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen gɛtɛ ɩ kààrà bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe e muru Isareli bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />Yahwe ɛ da ma wɔ bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bè di wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ boo koro ɛ dɔ̀ alan, <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />&lt;&lt;Yuda wogyu Manase ɛ mɛ ade-kyʋnlɛ. Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen gɛtɛ ɩ kààrà Amori bete booyo gɛtɛ be gyegeye bɛ mɛ fɔ, gɛ wʋ yɛ Yuda bete bɛ mɛ ade-kpen gɛtɛ bɛ sʋma bekpen fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ alan,&lt;&lt;Nan yɛ gyerebi ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba Yerusalem ma Yuda ntʋnkwaa powu boo koro gɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ waà dʋrɔ wɔ onyun. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />Nan tiira Yerusalem giten anlɛ gɛtɛ na tiira Samariya giten fɔ, anlɛ gɛtɛ nan tiira Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Ahabi ma wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ fɔ. Nan kpa Yerusalem bɛnɩ anlɛ gɩtɩyɛ gɛ be fere gɛ be fi gi be tin. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Gɛ nan tiri bʋnʋn n ye mɩɩn bɛnɩ gɛtɛ baà kuruma fɔ boo koro, gɛ nan ka bɛ n sa bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ. Bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ baà kpila gɩnyan-kpara-kamasɛ be ye bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />Yema bɛ mɛ ade-kpen mɩɩ bʋnʋn gɛtɛ wʋ sa mɩ owurufa ye duwi gɛtɛ bootu ɛbɛ be ye Egyipiti bè ye ma ǹdò.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ biri wʋ̀ fɩya fɔ n di alɛ, Manase e wolo bɛnɩ kpekpesi gɛtɛ bɛn nyɩ̀ ade ɩkɩ yaanɩ, gɛ nkalan wʋ yɛ wʋʋ da ma isele gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yerusalem fɔ. Ɛ mɛ nyayɩ ɛ fɩya ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ ɛ gban Yuda bete ɛ sa dikpen-sʋma daanɩ, gɛ wʋ yɛ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Bɛ ŋwara Manase wade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma wade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ powu, ma ade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Manase e ku gɛ be lò wɔ wo digyukpaara diilibi gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Usa wolibi fɔ waanɩ. Gɛ wobi-teni Amon e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Amon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Bɛ sɩ̀ Amon bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma bʋnyɔɔ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan-bʋnyɔɔ. Wɔna diyere n di Mesulemeti, Harusi wobi-nanɩ gɛtɛ e ye Yotiba fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ wote Manase ɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />Ɛ tɛrɛma gɛ wote wo-isele powu. Ɛ sʋma bekpen gɛtɛ wote ɛ sʋma fɔ gɛ ɛ waran e kura bɛ. <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />E terema Yahwe, wotu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ gɛ ɛn san Yahwe wosele waanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Amon bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ tɔ be yela wo koro gɛ be wolo wɔ wo digyukpaara daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yuda bɛnɩ be wolo ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɔ be yela egyu-dɩrɛ Amon wo koro fɔ powu, gɛ bɛ ka wobi Yosiya bɛ sɩ bugyu be sere wote bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Bɛ ŋwara Amon wade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ fɔ powu, ma wade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Be lò Amon wɔ gɩsàn gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Usa wolibi waanɩ fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ wobi Yosiya e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yosiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />Bɛ sɩ̀ Yosiya bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan nɩyɛ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-dɩkɩ. Wɔna diyere n di Yedida, Adaya wobi-nanɩ gɛtɛ e ye Bosikati fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn gɛ ɛ san wotu Dafidi wo-isele powu yaanɩ. En fi san dɩbɩyan abɛɛ ologyi.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />Wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, egyu Yosiya ɛ sa gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Asaliya wobi-teni Safan gɛtɛ wotu n di Mesulam fɔ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ alan, <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />&lt;&lt;San gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Hilikiya wakʋn fɔ àà ma dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ ɛ kʋla sɩka gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛ ka bɛ ba Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ gɛ otunu wʋʋ bɛnyalɛ be to be ye bɛnɩ baakʋn fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" />Dɔ̀ wɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka sɩka fɔ sa ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be tiri bɛ sɩ̀ gɛ bɛɛ nya Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii koro fɔ bɔɔ gʋlɔ, fɔ bàà ka sɩka fɔ le gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ pɩna Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />Wù di gɛtɛ bàà le iyon yɩɩ bɛsalɩlɛ ma bɛmaralɛ, ma ɩpɔrɩ yii beserelɛ, fɔ àà biri yɛ bɛ bàà se iyon ma ataa kpalɩlɛ bàà ka pɩna Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" />Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn fɔ gii koro fɔ bɛ̀ ba nʋnkwarɩ, okoro wun di gɛtɛ yàà yɛ bɛ bàà mɛ akʋtan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Hilikiya ɛ dɔ̀ gɩkpa gɩɩ ŋwaralɛ Safan alan, &lt;&lt;Na we Ose wʋʋ gɩkpa fɔ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ.&gt;&gt; Ɛ ka gɩ ɛ tɛ Safan gɛ ɛ kalan gɩ. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Safan ɛ san egyu wakʋn ɛ ma dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aa bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ kʋla sɩka gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ sa gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn fɔ gii koro fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Safan ɛ dɔ̀ egyu alan, &lt;&lt;Gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Hilikiya ɛ ka gɩkpa gɩkɩ ɛ tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Safan ɛ kalan gɩ egyu bʋnʋn.<verse eid="2KI 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Gɛtɛ egyu fɔ ɛ nʋn Ise yɩɩ Gɩkpa fɔ gaagyebi fɔ, ɛ fɛɛran wɔ ngba. <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />Ɛ tɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Hilikiya, ma Safan wobi Ahikim, ma Mise wobi Akibori, ma gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Safan, ma egyu wɔsaranyan Asaya ose alan, <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />&lt;&lt;Ɩ san i ma lila Yahwe ɩ tɛ nmɩ ma Yuda bɛnɩ powu ka dama ade gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gɩkpa nyagɩ gɛtɛ be we fɔ gaanɩ lɛ. Yahwe ɛ ka wowurufa-dɩrɛ tii koro, yema tiitu ɛbɛ ben di gɩkpa fɔ gaade yii koro. Bɛn mɛ ade gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ ka dama tii koro fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Okoro gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Hilikiya, ma Ahikam, ma Akibori, ma Safan, ma Asaya bɛ san ɛtabʋrʋlɛ-nanɩ Hulida gɛtɛ wɔsan n di Tikifa wobi Salum gɛ wotu n di Harihasi gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya ngba gɛtɛ bɩ̀ sa Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ ii koro fɔ wakʋn. Ɛ̀ sa gɛ Yerusalem Wɔlanlan-Nyɔɔfɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ alan, &lt;Ɩ dɔ̀ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ sa yɩ maakʋn fɔ alan, <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />Yahwe alan, &lt; Nan yɛ gyerebi ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n Yerusalem ma wɔ bɛnɩ boo koro anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gɩkpa gɛtɛ Yuda wogyu ɛ kalan fɔ gaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Yema be kere mɩ gɛsʋma bɛ ya gɛ be kuma olife bɛ tɛ bekpen, gɛ bɛ mɛ bekpen bɛ sa mɩ owurufa. Miinwurufa waà tɔ Yerusalem wo koro gɛ wʋn nan nʋ̀n wʋ nya.&gt; <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Ɩ ma dɔ̀ Yuda wogyu gɛtɛ ɛ sa yɩ alɛ ɩ ma lila Yahwe ɩ nʋn fɔ alan, &lt;Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ dɔ̀ ka dama ade gɛtɛ ɩ nʋn lɛ alɛ, <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" />gɛtɛ i foma yaamɩnlɛ, gɛ ɩ warama koro gatɩn ɩ tɛ nmɩ Yahwe, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɩ nʋn gefura gɛtɛ na fura gɩfɩɩ fɔ ma gɩɩ bɛnɩ ma gɛfwala gaade gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ ka dama gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ ma gɩɩ bɛnɩ alɛ baà bɛ̀ mɛ bɛnɩ fwalalɛ fɔ, ɩ fɛɛran yɩɩ ngba gɛ i wula mɩɩn bʋnʋn fɔ, nmɩ Yahwe na nʋn yiinyun-tiri. <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro, nan yɛ yɩ yàà ku bàà lò yɩ olila waanɩ pɛ gyerebi gɛtɛ nan yɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba Yerusalem fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 22:20">Ɛwʋ gɛ be birima wanyun-gyebi fɔ bɛ ma dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yosiya ɛ pɩna ɛ tà Dikola ma Yahwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu Yosiya e kpèlè bɛndɩrɛ fɔ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yuda ma Yerusalem fɔ e tuma. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />Gɛ ɛwɔ ma Yuda bɛnɩ ma Yerusalem bɛnɩ, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ, ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ, (beyenpu oo, bɛkyɩnyɩn oo) ɛbɛ powu bɛ bʋn bɛ san Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ ɛ kalan Dikola dɩɩ gɩkpa gɛtɛ be we Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu fɔ ɛ tɔ e yela begyu boo geyelakʋn wuu Pila fɔ wʋʋpɩ gɛ ɛ pɩna ɛ tà Dikola ma Yahwe alɛ ɛɛ̀ ka woturu powu ma wɔkala ɛ tɛrɛma wɔ, gɛ eè di wo-ise ma wade-wùlàlɛ, ma wade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ fɔ yii koro anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara wanyun-gyebi bɛ sa Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ daanɩ fɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu be to Dikola fɔ bɛ sa.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />Gɛ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ Gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Hilikiya, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ-kurumakyɛɛ, ma bɛnyalɛ otunu fɔ alɛ be tiri anyan powu gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ bɛ tɛ ekpen Baali ma ekpen Asera ma gatala gaanyan yɩɩ gɛsʋma fɔ powu be ye Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. E kuma yɩ Yerusalem watuma, Kidiron dɩtagba dɩɩ dɩfa daanɩ gɛ ɛ ka yɩɩ bʋtɔ ɛ san Beteli ditele. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />E tiri bekpente gɛtɛ Yuda wogyu ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ bɛɛ tɛ gedi Yuda ditele ma Yerusalem dɩtele fɔ powu, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bee kuma olife bɛ tɛ Baali, ma ofila, ma ebon, ma aŋorobi, ma gatala gaanyan powu. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Ɛ ka Asera wo-iyon e ye Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ ɛ san Kidiron dɩtagba, Yerusalem watuma gɛ e kuma yɩ dʋkɔbɛ. Ɛ kpààra yɩ ɛ mɛ ɔnʋmʋ gɛ ɛ yasɩ itunbu fɔ e lù gɩfɩɩ fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ boo gelòkʋn. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />E biri e gbena fotoli beteni baakwo gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bɛnanɩ bɛɛ ban ngba gɛtɛ bɛɛ sa bɛ sʋma Asera fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Yosiya ɛ ma ka gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ powu e ye Yuda atele yaanɩ gɛ be be gbena asʋmakʋn fɔ powu, ye Geba ma sere Beseba, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ be kuma olifwi fɔ. Gɛ e biri e gbena akpen-kwo gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yosuwa ditele-dɩrɛ diitunu fɔ, ditele dɩɩkpakyalɛ wotunu gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ diitunu wʋʋ dɩbɩyanlɔ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Ma gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa asʋmakʋn fɔ bɛn mɛ gʋtʋn Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Yerusalem gba fɔ, bɛ yɛ bɛ be di boroboro gɛtɛ bɛn sa gɩfa-ŋanlɛ ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" />Egyu Yosiya e biri ɛ mɩna ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Tofeti gɛ wʋ̀ sa Ben Hinom dɩtagba daanɩ fɔ, fɔ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn nan nɩ talɩ ɛ ka wobi-teni abɛɛ wobi-nanɩ e kuma ɛ tɛ ekpen Moleki gedi. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Gɛ e tiri abengyi gɛtɛ Yuda wogyu ɛ mara gɛ ì yela ɩ̀ tɛ ofila wuukpen fɔ e ye Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn, gɛ e kuma tiiramisan ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè yela tɛ ofila wuukpen gbɛma ɛndɩrɛ Natan-Meleki dikwo fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" />Yosiya e gbena gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ Yuda begyu be sere Ahasi dikwo dɩɩ gatala fɔ, ma gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ Manase e sere Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daakpaara anyɔɔ fɔ yaanɩ. E tiri yɩ e ye dʋkɔ, gɛ e gbena yɩ buru-buru gɛ e fun yɩ ɛ sa Kidiron dɩtagba daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" />Gɛ asʋmakʋn gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yerusalem wofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn, olife wodon wʋʋ gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan gɛtɛ Isareli wogyu Solomon e sere fɔ, Yosiya e gbena yɩ. Fɔ Solomon e sere ekpen-nanɩ-kpen Asitoreti ɛ tɛ Sidon bete, gɛ e sere ekpen-teni-kpen Kemosi ɛ tɛ Mobi bete, gɛ e sere ekpen-kpen Moleki ɛ tɛ Amon bete. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Yosiya e gbena dɩsʋma daataa fɔ, gɛ e kebi Asera wo-iyon gɛ e kpila bɛnɩ baanankʋba ɛ yɔla dʋkɔbɛ.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ e biri e gbena gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Beteli ma dɩsʋmakʋn gɛtɛ Nebati wobi Yerobwam ɛ mɛ, gɛ ɛ ka Isareli bete ɛ sa ade-kpen yaanɩ fɔ. E kuma dɩsʋmakʋn fɔ gɛ ɛ kpààrà dɩ ɛ mɛ ɔnʋmʋ, gɛ e kuma Asera woyon fɔ mɔ. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yosiya e fi ɛ nya e silin, gɛ e we bɩsàn odon fɔ wuu koro. Gɛ ɛ ma tiri anankʋba e ye bɩsàn fɔ baanɩ gɛ e kuma yɩ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gii koro ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka ɛ sa yɩ dɩdɩɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama Wɔtabʋrʋlɛ wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ ade ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" />Gɛ egyu fɔ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yɩɩ gɩsàn gaataa gɛ n te we lɛ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wù di gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ e ye Yuda, gɛ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ ade gɛtɛ a mɛ Beteli gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn nyagɩ lɛ wɔ gɩsàn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Gɛ Yosiya ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kere gi ɩ ya. Ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ kara ha wanankʋba fɔ.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɛn kya wanankʋba, gɛ bɛn kya Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ be ye Samariya fɔ mɔ booyo.<verse eid="2KI 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Anlɛ gɛtɛ Yosiya ɛ bɔ ɛ mɛ Beteli fɔ, gɛlɛ ke gɛ e gbena asʋmakʋn gɛtɛ Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ be sere Samariya gɛ wʋ sa Yahwe owurufa fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Yosiya e belen asʋmakʋn yii gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ powu ayu gedi gɩɩ gaatɛ̀kʋn fɔ yii koro, gɛ e kuma bɛnɩ-nyalɛ baanankʋba yii koro. Gɛ e biri ɛ da Yerusalem.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu ose nyawʋ alan, &lt;&lt;I di gɛkààrà-da gii duwi fɔ ɩ tɛ Yahwe yɩɩ Wurubwarɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa Dikola dɩɩ gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Ye gɔdɔ gɩɩ bɛdɔ̀lɛ baawi yaanɩ, abɛɛ Isareli begyu baawi yaanɩ, abɛɛ Yuda begyu baawi yaanɩ powu fɔ, ben di Gɛkààrà-da anlɛ nyagɩ. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Mɔ Yosiya bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, be di Gɛkààrà-da gii duwi nyadɩ bɛ tɛ Yahwe Yerusalem anɩ.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Nkele mɔ Yosiya e tiri bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè bekpena fɔ ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ asɔlɔ-de, ma abwɔ-de, ma dɩkpaara dii bekpen bɔɔ bɛsʋmalɛ, ma bekpen-maralɛ bɔɔ bɛsʋmalɛ, ma anyan-kyʋnlɛ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ e we Yuda ma Yerusalem fɔ. Ɛ mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ fɔ waà wùlà alɛ e di ose fɔ waade gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gɩkpa gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩtɛ̀lɛ Hilikiya e we Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ dii koro.<verse eid="2KI 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Begyu gɛtɛ be gyegeye Yosiya bɛ sara, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ sara wɔ gama powu baanɩ fɔ, egyu ɛkɩ ɛn ma anlɛ Yosiya gɛtɛ ɛ ka woturu powu, ma wɔkala powu, ma wɔkɛma powu ɛ tɛrɛma Yahwe anlɛ gɛtɛ Mose wose ii wùlà fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Mɔ Yahwe wowurufa-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛ ka Yuda wo koro yema ade gɛtɛ Manase ɛ mɛ fɔ wuunyun wun ku.<verse eid="2KI 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />Okoro Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nan mɛ Yuda anlɛ gɛtɛ na mɛ Isareli fɔ. Nan tiri Yuda bete n ye mɩɩn bʋnʋn baanɩ, gɛ nan terema Yerusalem, ditele gɛtɛ na tiri dàà mɛ miinyo, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ daade alan, &lt;Miin diyere daà sara dʋkɔ.&gt; fɔ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Bɛ ŋwara Yosiya wade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ fɔ powu ma wade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Yosiya è di egyu fɔ, Egyipiti wogyu gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Neko fɔ ɛ san Efrati getu gɩɩ gɩlan ɛ ma kpa Asiriya wogyu. Gɛ Egyu Yosiya e ye ɛ ma tuma wɔ bàà tà bɩtà, mɔ Neko e wolo Yosiya Megido. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Yosiya bɛsaranyan bɛ ka wo gikpena bɛ sa tiiramisan anɩ be ye Migido ditele daanɩ bɛ ba Yerusalem gɛ be lò wɔ ɛwɔ gbagba gɩsàn gaanɩ. Ɛwʋ gɛ Yuda bɛnɩ bɛ ka Yosiya wobi-teni Yehwahasi bɛ sɩ̀ bugyu bɛ sɩ̀ wote gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yehwahasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Bɛ sɩ̀ Yehwahasi bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma bʋnyɔɔ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan-bisiyee. Wɔna diyere n di Hamutali gɛtɛ è di Yeremiya wobi-nanɩ, gɛ e ye Libina fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ wotu ɛbɛ bɛ bɔ bɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Farawo Neko ɛ sa wɔ agbarɩgbarɩ Ribila, Hamati gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ ɛ kara talɩ e di bugyu Yerusalem. Ɛwʋ gɛ Neko e belen lonpoo ɛ sɩ̀ Yuda alɛ e le sɩka-fututu gɛtɛ wʋʋdʋrʋ waà mɛ anlɛ simiti bɛbagɩ akpilin asiyee ma fwo-ton ma sɩka sɩya gɛtɛ wʋʋdʋrʋ waà mɛ bekilo dikpilin ma fwo-bɛnaa. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" />Farawo Neko ɛ mɛ Yosiya wobi-teni Eliyakim egyu e sere wote bɩsɩrɩ gɛ e foma Eliyakim diyere ɛ mɛ Yehoyakim. Mɔ ɛ ka Yohwahasi ɛ san Egyipiti gɛ ɛ ma ku dʋkɔbɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Yehoyakim e le Farawo Neko sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ e lila fɔ. E to kɔba e ye gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ baakʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛkamasɛ wɔkɛma wù we, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ talɩ wura kɔba le Egyipiti wogyu Neko.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yehoyakim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />Bɛ sɩ̀ Yehoyakim bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan fwo dɩkɩ. Wɔna diyere n di Sebida gɛtɛ è di Pedaya wobi-nanɩ, gɛ e ye Ruma fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ wotu ɛbɛ bɛ bɔ bɛ mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Yehoyakim ee di bugyu fɔ, Babilon wogyu Nebukadinesa e be to Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa. Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehoyakim ɛ sara wɔ gatɩn bɩkyan bisiyee. Mɔ e foma wamɩnlɛ gɛ ɛ tɔ e yela Nebukadinesa wo koro. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ sa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ e ye Babilon, ma Aram, ma Mowabi, ma Amon alɛ bàà be muru Yuda bete, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama wɔ bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bè di wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ boo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" />Yahwe gbagba na yɛ gɛ ade nyayɩ ɩ ba Yuda wo koro, fɔ èè wura tiri bɛ ye wɔ bʋnʋn, Manase wade-kpen ma ade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ yii koro, <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" />fɩya ma gɛtɛ e wolo bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛn nyɩ ade-ɩkɩ yaanɩ fɔ wuu koro, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ da bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛn nyɩ ade ɩkɩ bɔɔ nkalan e lulu Yerusalem anɩ fɔ. Gɛ Yahwe en yera ka kyɛ wɔ.<verse eid="2KI 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Bɛ ŋwara Yehoyakim wade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma wade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Yehoyakim e ku, gɛ wobi Yehoyakin e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2KI 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Gɛ Egyipiti wogyu-dɩrɛ en mini ye ɛwɔ gbagba ditele daanɩ alɛ ɛɛ ma to gɛtʋnkwaa, yema Babilon wogyu-dɩrɛ e to wɔ ntʋnkwaa powu ye Egyipiti wɔbalan wʋʋpɩ ka bɛ da san Efrati getu gɩɩpɩ.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yehoyakin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yehoyakin e di bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan fwo-nɩyɛ. Gɛ e di bugyu fɔ Yerusalem bebon besiyee. Wɔna diyere n di Nehusita gɛtɛ è di Elinatan wobi-nanɩ gɛtɛ e ye Yerusalem fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ wote ɛ bɔ ɛ mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Babilon wogyu Nebukadinesa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ tɔ bɛ san bɩtà Yerusalem gɛ bɛ sʋ ditele fɔ bɛ sa. <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />Nebukadinesa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ gɛsʋ ditele fɔ sa waanɩ fɔ, ɛwɔ gbagba ɛ ba daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yehoyakin, ma wɔna, ma wɔ bɛnɩ, ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn digyukpaara daanɩ fɔ powu bɛ ka koro bɛ tɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 24:12">Nebukadinesa bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, e gye Yehoyakin ɛ ma tan dikwo. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />E kpila anyan-kpara ma anyan ma ɔyɛ-kɛma gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ ma digyukpaara fɔ powu. Gɛ e kpila sɩka-sɩya wanyan powu gɛtɛ Isareli wogyu Solomon ɛ mɛ ɛ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />Nebukadinesa e gye Yerusalem powu ɛ da gisela. E gye bɛndɩrɛbi ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ, ma adawʋ yɩɩ bɛsalɛ fɔ powu, ma bɛwɔrɔ. Ɛbɛ powu bɛ̀ ba bɛnɩ ɩgba ton. Beyenpu booko na kuruma.<verse eid="2KI 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" />Nebukadinesa e gye Yehoyakin bɩtà ɛ san Babilon fɩya ma wɔna, ma wɔsɔ ɛbɛ, ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn digyukpaara daanɩ fɔ, ma wɔ gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ gbaa-gbaa. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Nebukadinesa e nɩ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ baasɔ ɩ̀ ba ɩgba isiyee ma nkpɩn ton (7,000), gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba ɔkɛma, gɛ bɛ kʋtʋma bɩtà bʋʋ-san fɔ, ma adawʋ yɩɩ bɛsalɛ, ma bɛwɔrɔ nkpɩn ton (1,000). <verse eid="2KI 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" />Gɛ Nebukadinesa ɛ sɩ̀ Yehoyakin wogbete Mataniya bugyu ɛ tɛ Yuda bete, gɛ e foma wo diyere alɛ Sedekiya.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Sedekiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Sedekiya e di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma dɩkɩ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan fwo-ɛkɩ. Wɔna diyere n di Hamutali, Yeremiya wobi-nanɩ fɔ wobi. E ye Libina. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ Yehoyakim ɛ bɔ ɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" />Ade nyayɩ ɩ ba Yerusalem ma Yuda boo koro, yema bɛ sa Yahwe owurufa-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ wʋ yɛ e tiri bɛ e ye wɔ bʋnʋn.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2KI 24:20">Yerusalem gɛnʋ̀n</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 24:20">Gɛ Sedekiya ɛ bɛ tɔ e yela Babilon wogyu-dɩrɛ wo koro.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Sedekiya bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-nɩyɛfɛ giibon-fwofɛ wo duwi-fwofɛ daanɩ fɔ, Babilon wogyu Nebukadinesa ɛ ka wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ɛ san bàà ma kpà ma Yerusalem ditele. Bɛ sara ditele fɔ daatuma, gɛ ɛ yɛ be silin ditele fɔ be tuma. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Bɛ sʋ ditele fɔ gɛlɛɛ ma ye egyu-dɩrɛ Sedekiya gɩkyan fwo-gɩkɩfɛ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Ebon-naafɛ duwi yɛkɩfɛ daanɩ fɔ, dɩkpan gɛtɛ dɩ nʋ̀n ditele fɔ daanɩ fɔ diinyun wʋ mɛ ɔkɛma gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛn taa wura anyandilɛ bàà di. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ be duru ditele fɔ dɩɩpɔrɩ, gbɛma egyu-dɩrɛ wolibi, gɛ odente wʋtɔkɔ be serenti be ye ditele fɔ daanɩ, ma gɛtɛ Babilon bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be silin ditele fɔ be tuma gba fɔ. Gɛ be serenti bɛ ka ma Yodan dɩtagba dɩɩ gɩlan. <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Mɔ Babilon bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be serenti be berema egyu fɔ gɛ bɛ ma tama wɔ Yeriko wɔtalɩ waanɩ. Gɛ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu bɛ yasɩ bɛ yɛ wɔ, <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />gɛ be gye wɔ. Bɛ ka wɔ bɛ sama Babilon wogyu Ribila ditele daanɩ, dʋkɔ gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ gɔdɔ gɛ be tin wɔ dɩpwɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Be wolo Sedekiya bebi-teni wɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ, gɛ bɛ kyɔlɔ wɔ bʋnʋn baabi. Bɛ ban wɔ gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gaagbarɩgbarɩ gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ da Babilon.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />Babilon wogyu Nebukadinesa wo bugyu buu gedi bʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-yɛkɩfɛ, wuubon-tonfɛ wo duwi kwarankɩfɛ daanɩ fɔ, Nebusaradan gɛtɛ è di ɛdɩyɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ, gɛ è biri è di Babilon wogyu wɔndɩrɛbi fɔ e be gyu Yerusalem. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Ɛ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma digyukpaara, ma akpaara powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yerusalem fɔ ɔtan. E kuma dɩkpaara-kpara-kamasɛ muruyo. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Babilon bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa ɛndɩrɛ-bi Nebusaradan gatɩn fɔ be gbena Yerusalem wɔ-ɩpɔrɩ fɔ powu be tin. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Nebusaradan gɛtɛ è di egyu bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ e gye bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be kuruma ditele fɔ daanɩ, ma ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa gɩlan dʋkɔ fɔ ɛ san Babilon, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ wɛrɛ ka koro bɛ tɛ Babilon wogyu fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Mɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ e kere bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bee we ayenpu-de bɛ kààrà fɔ ɛ ya gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ fɔ bàà tɩ mɛ gʋtʋn wayɩn wo-ili ma ili kurumakyɛɛ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />Babilon bete be gbena gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gii bepila fɔ, ma gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gii tiiramisan ɛbɛ ma baaka, ma gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gɩɩ tasa-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ powu, gɛ be kpila yɩ bɛ da Babilon. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" />Gɛ be biri bɛ ka isun, ma bɛsɔfɩ, ma omini-tiiralɛ kandɩya wayenkpen, ma bɛtasa, ma bɩtɩyɛ, ma gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gaanyan powu gɛtɛ bɛ ka bɛ mɛ dɩsʋma daade Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Egyu bɛdɩyɛlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ ɛ ka olifwi wʋʋ tasa ma bɛtasabi, ma gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya-kpara abɛɛ sɩka-fututu bɛ mɛ fɔ ɛ da.<verse eid="2KI 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Anyan gɛtɛ egyu Solomon ɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya ɛ mɛ ɛ sɩ̀ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ n di bepila bɛnyɔɔ, ma tasa-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma abʋn-yelakʋn fɔ, ì di anyan gɛtɛ bɛn talɩ kɛrɛ yɩ. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Pila-kamasɛ watɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma kwarankɩ. Gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya giimini gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gyaga pila-kamasɛ duyu fɔ waatɔ waà mɛ bɩsɩrɩ bɩnaa ma ɔfan gɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ mɛ agbarɩgbarɩ ma pomegraniti abi bɛ sa wʋ adawʋ be silin. Pila-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ ma waagbarɩgbarɩ powu ɛ̀ bɔ è we gɛ anlɛ bepila-do fɔ.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Digyu-kpara dɩɩ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ e gye gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ Seraya, ma Sefaniya gɛtɛ è di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ wɔmalɛ, ma bɛnɩ besiyee gɛtɛ bɛɛ dɩyɛ itunu yii koro fɔ ɛ ma tan. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />Ditele fɔ daanɩ fɔ, e gye bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ boo koro ma digyukpaara daamɩnlɛ yɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ. E biri e gye egyu gɩkpa gɩɩ ŋwaralɛ gɛtɛ è di egyu wɔndɩrɛ-bi gɛtɛ ɛwɔ n tɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ baayere gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ, ma wɔ bɛnɩ akpilin asiyee gɛtɛ e we ditele fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Egyu bɛdɩyɛlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ Nebusaradan ɛ ka ɛbɛ powu ɛ san Babilon wogyu wakʋn Ribila ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Ribila dʋkɔ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ e wolo ɛbɛ powu Hamati gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 25:21">Okoro anlɛ gɛ be gye Yuda bɛnɩ bɩtà gɛ bɛ ka bɛ be ye bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ bɛ da.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Babilon wogyu Nebukadinesa e tiri Ahikam wobi-teni Gedaliya gɛtɛ wotu n di Safan fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nya bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be kuruma Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ boo koro. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Ɔya gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ powu ma bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ nʋn alɛ Babilon wogyu ɛ sɩ̀ Gedaliya bɛndɩrɛ fɔ, bɛ ba Gedaliya wakʋn Misipa ditele daanɩ. Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ba fɔ n di, Netaniya wobi Isimayeli, ma Kareya wobi Yohanan, ma Tanhumeti-te Netofati wobi Seraya, ma Maakati-te wobi Yaasaniya ma bɔɔ bɛnɩ. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Gedaliya ɛ kan ntam ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ nyɩ ɛ tɛ ɛbɛ ma bɔɔ bɛnɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kara serenti Babilon bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ. Ɩ sara gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ fɔ yàà sʋma Babilon wogyu-dɩrɛ, gɛlɛ fɔ, ade powu yaà san gepe ɩ tɛ yɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Mɔ gɩkyan fɔ giibon kwarankɩfɛ anɩ fɔ, Netaniya wobi Isimayeli gɛtɛ wotu n di Elisama gɛ è di digyukpaara diidu waanɩ wʋʋnɩ ɛkɩ fɔ, ɛ ba ma bɛnɩ fwo gɛ be be wolo Gedaliya ma Yuda bɛnɩ ma Babilon bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma Gedaliya powu Misipa ditele daanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" />Okoro ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu, bɛkyɩnyɩn oo, beyenpu oo, fɩya ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛbi powu be serenti bɛ san Egyipiti yema bè serenti Babilon bete.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Be tiri Yehoyakin be ye gegye-tankʋn</para>
  <para style="r">(Yer 52:31-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />Yuda wogyu Yehoyakin wo gegye-an gisela wʋʋ gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-kwarankɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Babilon wogyu Efili-Merodaki ɛ bɛ mɛ Babilon wogyu. Ebon fwo-nyɔɔfɛ wo duwi dikpilin ma kwarankɩfɛ daanɩ fɔ, e tiri Yehoyakin e ye gegye-tankʋn. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Babilon wogyu ɛɛ tɩ̀ tabʋrʋ ma Yehoyakin gelen gaanɩ gɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ gebù ɛ da begyu-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ Babilon fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Okoro Yehoyakin e tiri wo gegye-tan wʋʋ ngba fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ gɩlan gɛ wɔ nkpa awi powu yaanɩ fɔ, e di gɩtɩyɛ-kɩlɩn gaanɩ ma egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Gɛ Babilon wogyu ɛɛ tɛ wɔ kɔba duwi n di duwi èè se gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ee hiyan wɔ nkpa awi powu yaanɩ.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>